(227192, 13263, 3972, '<td valign="top">Beautiful texture - I thought for a second that they weren''t real eggs - but looking at the dimples in the shell on the red one at the front I now realise that they must be. <br/> <br/>I really like the contrast between the way the shells have been artificaially dressed up and the played-down but natural nesting.<br/> <br/>Very, very good.</td>', 'Beautiful texture - I thought for a second that they weren''t real eggs - but looking at the dimples in the shell on the red one at the front I now realise that they must be.  I really like the contrast between the way the shells have been artificaially dressed up and the played-down but natural nesting. Very, very good.', '2003-03-03 02:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
