(227380, 13464, 917, '<td valign="top">Could have made more of the table texture, and also used the grain better. Try it with the grain running diagonal, and the egg placed off of the center line. The reflection is not really strong enough to support the title.</td>', 'Could have made more of the table texture, and also used the grain better. Try it with the grain running diagonal, and the egg placed off of the center line. The reflection is not really strong enough to support the title.', '2003-03-03 09:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
