(227426, 13206, 917, '<td valign="top">Is this a reference to that classic of market research? Housewives felt guilty about using readymix, so they put ''Add an Egg'' on the packets so the Missus felt she was still contributing some effort, and thus ''baking'' rather than cheating. Perhaps your picture could have alluded to that, because as it is, it doesnt really say anything.</td>', 'Is this a reference to that classic of market research? Housewives felt guilty about using readymix, so they put ''Add an Egg'' on the packets so the Missus felt she was still contributing some effort, and thus ''baking'' rather than cheating. Perhaps your picture could have alluded to that, because as it is, it doesnt really say anything.', '2003-03-03 10:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
