(227766, 13446, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is so funny, I laughed just seeing the thumbnail. It is very original and perfectly composed. The subject looks just like a hen and the expression on his face is so fitting.</td>', 'This is so funny, I laughed just seeing the thumbnail. It is very original and perfectly composed. The subject looks just like a hen and the expression on his face is so fitting.', '2003-03-03 14:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
