(227769, 13380, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve given such a simple shot so much charachter. This is one of my favourites, the chain around the wrist just improves the quality of this shot. This will score high!</td>', 'You''ve given such a simple shot so much charachter. This is one of my favourites, the chain around the wrist just improves the quality of this shot. This will score high!', '2003-03-03 14:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(227772, 13281, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve come up with a very good idea here and to top it off you have composed it perfectly. One of my favourites this week. The lighting is so good, and not a sign of any hotspots. Only that little dot between the 2 and 3 is out of place but I am being a little too critical mentioning that right?</td>', 'You''ve come up with a very good idea here and to top it off you have composed it perfectly. One of my favourites this week. The lighting is so good, and not a sign of any hotspots. Only that little dot between the 2 and 3 is out of place but I am being a little too critical mentioning that right?', '2003-03-03 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(227774, 13271, 5728, '<td valign="top">The colour combination is amazing! Somehow you''ve create an illusion that the top of this vase is leaning back in perspective to the bottom. This is very good and will get a top score, I know it.</td>', 'The colour combination is amazing! Somehow you''ve create an illusion that the top of this vase is leaning back in perspective to the bottom. This is very good and will get a top score, I know it.', '2003-03-03 14:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(227775, 13382, 5728, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, so clear and sharp (and funny!!!). You chose a good title, very fitting. I hope you do well with this, you deserve it.</td>', 'Cool shot, so clear and sharp (and funny!!!). You chose a good title, very fitting. I hope you do well with this, you deserve it.', '2003-03-03 14:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(227776, 13216, 3102, '<td valign="top">The reflections take a good bit away from this, I''m afraid.  You might try draping a black backdrop behind the camera to minimize the reflections a bit.</td>', 'The reflections take a good bit away from this, I''m afraid.  You might try draping a black backdrop behind the camera to minimize the reflections a bit.', '2003-03-03 14:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
