(227999, 13430, 6999, '<td valign="top">another top photo - the only thing I could possibly criticise is the depth of field: I really want to see more of the texture of those eggs!</td>', 'another top photo - the only thing I could possibly criticise is the depth of field: I really want to see more of the texture of those eggs!', '2003-03-03 17:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
