(228005, 13263, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very very beautiful - not quite my favourite, but damn close. Really close, thinking about it. I think the colouring is perhaps a little contrived? No not that - the patterns are too much for me. Maybe. It gets better the more I look at it; congratulations on a lovely photo.</td>', 'Very very beautiful - not quite my favourite, but damn close. Really close, thinking about it. I think the colouring is perhaps a little contrived? No not that - the patterns are too much for me. Maybe. It gets better the more I look at it; congratulations on a lovely photo.', '2003-03-03 17:51:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(228007, 13266, 3942, '<td valign="top">I like your creative and unique idea!  But IMHO there is some space for improvement by post processing.  More contrasts in the sky (darker blue) and a little higher saturation of the yellow could have been helpful here. Nevertheless a nice shot!</td>', 'I like your creative and unique idea!  But IMHO there is some space for improvement by post processing.  More contrasts in the sky (darker blue) and a little higher saturation of the yellow could have been helpful here. Nevertheless a nice shot!', '2003-03-03 17:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(228008, 13515, 6999, '<td valign="top">Almost ... almost ... I get the impression that maybe just a plain egg you thought would be too boring? Nice clean focus though</td>', 'Almost ... almost ... I get the impression that maybe just a plain egg you thought would be too boring? Nice clean focus though', '2003-03-03 17:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(228011, 13461, 3607, '<td valign="top">i think having the eggs in the shadow as opposed to in the light which might bring out the colors more detracts from the photo.  i do like the idea.</td>', 'i think having the eggs in the shadow as opposed to in the light which might bring out the colors more detracts from the photo.  i do like the idea.', '2003-03-03 17:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
