(228015, 13321, 3607, '<td valign="top">there is an interesting pattern reflected in the eggs (i like that).  i wish there had been something in the picture to give a better idea of scale, because this is probably a pretty good macro shot that isn''t that obvious that it''s macro.</td>', 'there is an interesting pattern reflected in the eggs (i like that).  i wish there had been something in the picture to give a better idea of scale, because this is probably a pretty good macro shot that isn''t that obvious that it''s macro.', '2003-03-03 18:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
