(228018, 13249, 3942, '<td valign="top">Unique and very creative, one of my favorites this week. The colors are working great together, the saturation is awesome. Your cropping makes it an interesting photo. Apart from the little reflection in the bottom left area of the egg there is nothing, what you could have done better here. But I know, that it''s nearly impossible to eliminate them on a wet surface. Great work an good luck for the challenge!</td>', 'Unique and very creative, one of my favorites this week. The colors are working great together, the saturation is awesome. Your cropping makes it an interesting photo. Apart from the little reflection in the bottom left area of the egg there is nothing, what you could have done better here. But I know, that it''s nearly impossible to eliminate them on a wet surface. Great work an good luck for the challenge!', '2003-03-03 18:04:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(228019, 13331, 3607, '<td valign="top">camouflaged eggs . . . cool.  increasing the saturation might have made the green look a bit more fresh.</td>', 'camouflaged eggs . . . cool.  increasing the saturation might have made the green look a bit more fresh.', '2003-03-03 18:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
