(228151, 13462, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice picture.  The angle make me initally think the eggs are flying out of the basket.  After looking at it for a minute - I get that maybe the eggs are placed in front of a basket laying on its side.  Maybe a different angle would work.</td>', 'Nice picture.  The angle make me initally think the eggs are flying out of the basket.  After looking at it for a minute - I get that maybe the eggs are placed in front of a basket laying on its side.  Maybe a different angle would work.', '2003-03-03 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(228152, 13481, 6740, '<td valign="top">The salt added a bit of flavor to the egg (photo). Nice touch.</td>', 'The salt added a bit of flavor to the egg (photo). Nice touch.', '2003-03-03 19:52:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(228153, 13468, 6532, '<td valign="top">Original.</td>', 'Original.', '2003-03-03 19:52:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(228154, 13445, 6532, '<td valign="top">Too many colors.  Wallpaper is distracting.</td>', 'Too many colors.  Wallpaper is distracting.', '2003-03-03 19:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(228155, 13347, 6740, '<td valign="top">It shows some originality. Cool photo.</td>', 'It shows some originality. Cool photo.', '2003-03-03 19:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(228156, 13474, 6505, '<td valign="top">I love the title.  The DOF is great.  B&amp;W works here.  Cropping is very nice too.  I think the wisk should have been right side up, however.</td>', 'I love the title.  The DOF is great.  B&W works here.  Cropping is very nice too.  I think the wisk should have been right side up, however.', '2003-03-03 19:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(228157, 13373, 6532, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Nice contrast.  Good timing with the boiling of the egg and only half way in the water.</td>', 'Cool.  Nice contrast.  Good timing with the boiling of the egg and only half way in the water.', '2003-03-03 19:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(228159, 13319, 6740, '<td valign="top">The dark background really makes the egg shells come to life. I did not that vinegar would do that to eggs. Nice pic.</td>', 'The dark background really makes the egg shells come to life. I did not that vinegar would do that to eggs. Nice pic.', '2003-03-03 19:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(228160, 13306, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wow. Fantastically bizarre - especially the ageing and colouring. Great shot</td>', 'Wow. Fantastically bizarre - especially the ageing and colouring. Great shot', '2003-03-03 19:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(228161, 13321, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2003-03-03 19:57:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(228162, 13363, 6740, '<td valign="top">I like the color scheme, the layout, and softness of the photo.</td>', 'I like the color scheme, the layout, and softness of the photo.', '2003-03-03 19:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(228164, 13378, 6999, '<td valign="top">:-) Nice gag.</td>', ':-) Nice gag.', '2003-03-03 19:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(228165, 13364, 6740, '<td valign="top">The colors are vivid, the reflections give it a touch of grace. Job well done.</td>', 'The colors are vivid, the reflections give it a touch of grace. Job well done.', '2003-03-03 19:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(228166, 13376, 6740, '<td valign="top">Maybe a bit to bright but I definitely am impressed. The lace shadow on the egg makes it unique.</td>', 'Maybe a bit to bright but I definitely am impressed. The lace shadow on the egg makes it unique.', '2003-03-03 20:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(228167, 13510, 6999, '<td valign="top">Ecxellent - this is like some of my own stuff, in a way. Really well done too - exposure seeme to have been an issue for so many people on this challenge and you''ve got it absolutely right I think - those highlights are maybe a little overdone but I like it that way.</td>', 'Ecxellent - this is like some of my own stuff, in a way. Really well done too - exposure seeme to have been an issue for so many people on this challenge and you''ve got it absolutely right I think - those highlights are maybe a little overdone but I like it that way.', '2003-03-03 20:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(228168, 13434, 6532, '<td valign="top">Great and original angle!!!</td>', 'Great and original angle!!!', '2003-03-03 20:03:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(228169, 13295, 6740, '<td valign="top">Time and effort well spent. The color scheme is nice and the length of the fall is a important factor.</td>', 'Time and effort well spent. The color scheme is nice and the length of the fall is a important factor.', '2003-03-03 20:04:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(228170, 13485, 6532, '<td valign="top">I like the color of the eggs!  The basket seems to be floating - i would prefer to ground or anchor it.</td>', 'I like the color of the eggs!  The basket seems to be floating - i would prefer to ground or anchor it.', '2003-03-03 20:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(228172, 13345, 6532, '<td valign="top">Yummy.  Consider putting it on a different type of surface.</td>', 'Yummy.  Consider putting it on a different type of surface.', '2003-03-03 20:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(228174, 13401, 6532, '<td valign="top">Nice angle.</td>', 'Nice angle.', '2003-03-03 20:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(228175, 13317, 6999, '<td valign="top">A kind of Egg Noir effect?</td>', 'A kind of Egg Noir effect?', '2003-03-03 20:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(228176, 13352, 2158, '<td valign="top">Cute picture well arranged, but either your lighting is a bit too harsh or the picture is overexposed.</td>', 'Cute picture well arranged, but either your lighting is a bit too harsh or the picture is overexposed.', '2003-03-03 20:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(228177, 13359, 6110, '<td valign="top">Be careful with exposures on white subjects, they get blown out easily.</td>', 'Be careful with exposures on white subjects, they get blown out easily.', '2003-03-03 20:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(228178, 13294, 6110, '<td valign="top">Like the lighting, not sure about the water drops.</td>', 'Like the lighting, not sure about the water drops.', '2003-03-03 20:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(228179, 13215, 616, '<td valign="top">nicely done. The high key look of this shot was a great idea and you have executed it very well. Your lighting here is excellent! It''s great how subtle the shadows are, yet they are defined and work great here.</td>', 'nicely done. The high key look of this shot was a great idea and you have executed it very well. Your lighting here is excellent! It''s great how subtle the shadows are, yet they are defined and work great here.', '2003-03-03 20:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(228181, 13460, 6110, '<td valign="top">Pretty funny!  Good setup, maybe just a touch dark?</td>', 'Pretty funny!  Good setup, maybe just a touch dark?', '2003-03-03 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(228183, 13342, 6110, '<td valign="top">Good timing!  Run levels or curves to brighten this shot, and if you have enough pixels, a tighter crop on the baby might be very effective.</td>', 'Good timing!  Run levels or curves to brighten this shot, and if you have enough pixels, a tighter crop on the baby might be very effective.', '2003-03-03 20:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
