(228269, 13215, 3724, '<td valign="top">your rainbow visual effects are retained in PictureViewer, which means they are intended. my premium viewer - quicktime makes the effects quite differently than on the net.......  and it showed your colour is even more pronounced.  often when a rainbow effect is present in a pic,  quicktime shows it without the artifact.   The opposite of what yours did.</td>', 'your rainbow visual effects are retained in PictureViewer, which means they are intended. my premium viewer - quicktime makes the effects quite differently than on the net.......  and it showed your colour is even more pronounced.  often when a rainbow effect is present in a pic,  quicktime shows it without the artifact.   The opposite of what yours did.', '2003-03-03 21:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
