(228333, 13447, 4648, '<td valign="top">I do not like nude photos at all....But on this one I will give you credit for a very unique, and well done with one exception - you carried it TOO LOW -, photo.  This shows very much initiative.  You just never should have gone so low.  It would have had a better effect and appealed to more people.  Cut off just below the eggs I would have given it a 10.  As low as you took it I would only give it a 3.  Go for the artistic and uou do very well.  When you go too far you stand the chance of offending too many people, and not just me.  You don''t have to be a fanatic to be offended.  I wish you had left it a well done, beautiful piece of artistic work.</td>', 'I do not like nude photos at all....But on this one I will give you credit for a very unique, and well done with one exception - you carried it TOO LOW -, photo.  This shows very much initiative.  You just never should have gone so low.  It would have had a better effect and appealed to more people.  Cut off just below the eggs I would have given it a 10.  As low as you took it I would only give it a 3.  Go for the artistic and uou do very well.  When you go too far you stand the chance of offending too many people, and not just me.  You don''t have to be a fanatic to be offended.  I wish you had left it a well done, beautiful piece of artistic work.', '2003-03-03 22:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
