(228627, 13468, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is hilarious! What an original idea, I am always amazed to see photos like this and have to ask myself why didn''t I think of that. You did it very well. The shallow DOF is just enough to keep all the important parts in focus.</td>', 'This is hilarious! What an original idea, I am always amazed to see photos like this and have to ask myself why didn''t I think of that. You did it very well. The shallow DOF is just enough to keep all the important parts in focus.', '2003-03-04 06:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(228628, 13342, 3735, '<td valign="top">A little more contrast should have been used, but i gave you a 10 for originality</td>', 'A little more contrast should have been used, but i gave you a 10 for originality', '2003-03-04 06:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(228631, 13471, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo is not fully in focus which spoils the impact somewhat. You also should have cropped that little blue line up in the left hand corner, it is distracting.</td>', 'This photo is not fully in focus which spoils the impact somewhat. You also should have cropped that little blue line up in the left hand corner, it is distracting.', '2003-03-04 06:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
