(228723, 13292, 6182, '<td valign="top">nice photo...i like the cropping and the idea behind it.   i would like to see the eggs brought into focus a little more and i think it needs a border to hold it together a little tighter...i gave it a nine because i like the originality and the colors (i\''m a huge patriot!)</td>', 'nice photo...i like the cropping and the idea behind it.   i would like to see the eggs brought into focus a little more and i think it needs a border to hold it together a little tighter...i gave it a nine because i like the originality and the colors (i\''m a huge patriot!)', '2003-03-04 09:59:31.000000', NULL, 1),
