(228727, 13462, 6182, '<td valign="top">Really nice still life...my only complaint is the texture of that one egg that has the bumps on it...i probably would have chosen a smoother egg for that high profile position in your composition.   i like the natural colors and your lighting is nice.   probably would be better with a little sharper focus, especially on the eggs in front.</td>', 'Really nice still life...my only complaint is the texture of that one egg that has the bumps on it...i probably would have chosen a smoother egg for that high profile position in your composition.   i like the natural colors and your lighting is nice.   probably would be better with a little sharper focus, especially on the eggs in front.', '2003-03-04 10:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
