(228823, 13257, 6999, '<td valign="top">Whilst I liked this shot, and gave it a decent mark, there are two reasons I haven''t given it a better score: I don;t like the composition - the primary image is dead centre and the eye wanders away too easily, and the way that cantral egg masks those behind it seems ... well hurried, i guess. I''m also not sure about the visibility of the black carpet (or whatever it is) - whether or not it is, it looks accidental. Technically, other than those small points, a nice shot though.</td>', 'Whilst I liked this shot, and gave it a decent mark, there are two reasons I haven''t given it a better score: I don;t like the composition - the primary image is dead centre and the eye wanders away too easily, and the way that cantral egg masks those behind it seems ... well hurried, i guess. I''m also not sure about the visibility of the black carpet (or whatever it is) - whether or not it is, it looks accidental. Technically, other than those small points, a nice shot though.', '2003-03-04 12:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(228825, 13503, 6999, '<td valign="top">A couple of things that stopped me rating this higher: it doesn''t seem quie perfectly in focus: either that or the depth of field is really too shallow - my eye keeps being pulled to the cloth rather than the egg. And I''m afraid I got pretty fed-up of white eggs in this challenge (which is just your misfortune as to where it appeared in my viewing). <br/> <br/>Something also seems to have gone awry with re-sizing, or some process. Those artifacts around the edges of the egg?</td>', 'A couple of things that stopped me rating this higher: it doesn''t seem quie perfectly in focus: either that or the depth of field is really too shallow - my eye keeps being pulled to the cloth rather than the egg. And I''m afraid I got pretty fed-up of white eggs in this challenge (which is just your misfortune as to where it appeared in my viewing).  Something also seems to have gone awry with re-sizing, or some process. Those artifacts around the edges of the egg?', '2003-03-04 12:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
