(228955, 13418, 6451, '<td valign="top">The fake chicken sort of takes away the art of this photo. But good idea.</td>', 'The fake chicken sort of takes away the art of this photo. But good idea.', '2003-03-04 14:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(228961, 13291, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract...  I think a slight rotation of the egg or camera to create a little more diagonal would also work well... - setzler</td>', 'interesting abstract...  I think a slight rotation of the egg or camera to create a little more diagonal would also work well... - setzler', '2003-03-04 14:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(228963, 13133, 772, '<td valign="top">nice closeup and interesting use of light.. - setzler</td>', 'nice closeup and interesting use of light.. - setzler', '2003-03-04 14:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(228965, 13515, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good photo but the contrast between the egg and the background seems rather flat... - setzler</td>', 'This is a good photo but the contrast between the egg and the background seems rather flat... - setzler', '2003-03-04 14:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(229014, 13403, 6701, '<td valign="top">The lighting on this shot is really great.  It gives a very cosmic quality to the rather banal subject of an egg.  I think it fits the challenge perfectly, instilling interest into the rather boring subject that is the egg.</td>', 'The lighting on this shot is really great.  It gives a very cosmic quality to the rather banal subject of an egg.  I think it fits the challenge perfectly, instilling interest into the rather boring subject that is the egg.', '2003-03-04 15:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(229015, 13514, 6701, '<td valign="top">The contrast between the sharpness of the knife and the softness of the egg is wonderful  This is added to by the sharpness of focus on the knife and softness of focus on the egg.  Good range of tones for a black and white shot.</td>', 'The contrast between the sharpness of the knife and the softness of the egg is wonderful  This is added to by the sharpness of focus on the knife and softness of focus on the egg.  Good range of tones for a black and white shot.', '2003-03-04 15:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(229017, 13382, 6701, '<td valign="top">The texture is what made me vote ten on this shot.  Plus the engaging subject matter.  Great range of earth tone colors too.</td>', 'The texture is what made me vote ten on this shot.  Plus the engaging subject matter.  Great range of earth tone colors too.', '2003-03-04 15:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(229018, 13220, 6701, '<td valign="top">The focus could be a little sharper, but otherwise a wonderful image.  The layout is engaging, the shadow play is nice, and the tonal range is great.  One of my favorite shots of the week.</td>', 'The focus could be a little sharper, but otherwise a wonderful image.  The layout is engaging, the shadow play is nice, and the tonal range is great.  One of my favorite shots of the week.', '2003-03-04 15:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(229020, 13476, 6701, '<td valign="top">A very tasteful, and well done nude shot.  I love the detail captured in the skin.  I think the centric composition works well for this shot, and it''s stopped from being too centered by the balance of shadows from the lighting.</td>', 'A very tasteful, and well done nude shot.  I love the detail captured in the skin.  I think the centric composition works well for this shot, and it''s stopped from being too centered by the balance of shadows from the lighting.', '2003-03-04 15:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(229027, 13445, 3569, '<td valign="top">I liked the idea and set-up, the flash did you wrong.</td>', 'I liked the idea and set-up, the flash did you wrong.', '2003-03-04 15:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(229028, 13315, 3569, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of Sanibel, with an egg.  Good shot.</td>', 'Reminds me of Sanibel, with an egg.  Good shot.', '2003-03-04 15:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(229030, 13179, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  To bad the goose isn''t a bit sharper.</td>', 'Great idea.  To bad the goose isn''t a bit sharper.', '2003-03-04 15:58:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(229031, 13342, 3569, '<td valign="top">It may have looked better if you would have cropped the foreground dark shadow out, just below the wee gater.  Otherwise great shot.</td>', 'It may have looked better if you would have cropped the foreground dark shadow out, just below the wee gater.  Otherwise great shot.', '2003-03-04 16:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(229032, 13501, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great illusion.</td>', 'Great illusion.', '2003-03-04 16:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(229037, 13309, 2677, '<td valign="top">Possible cutting board for a surface?</td>', 'Possible cutting board for a surface?', '2003-03-04 16:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(229038, 13226, 2677, '<td valign="top">This should be in focus....</td>', 'This should be in focus....', '2003-03-04 16:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(229050, 13468, 772, '<td valign="top">this is an excellent photo.. the detail is nice.. it''s just visually unappealing to me personally... but that doesn''t take away from a good photo.. excellent work :) - setzler</td>', 'this is an excellent photo.. the detail is nice.. it''s just visually unappealing to me personally... but that doesn''t take away from a good photo.. excellent work :) - setzler', '2003-03-04 16:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
