(229445, 13212, 3273, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, I think it may have been better with more of a top-down view, we''d have been able to see more of the yolks that way.</td>', 'Nice shot, I think it may have been better with more of a top-down view, we''d have been able to see more of the yolks that way.', '2003-03-05 01:18:52.000000', NULL, 1),
