(229447, 13435, 6370, '<td valign="top">a nice shot.  Was way to fuzzy for my liking though.  a run through unsharp mask would have helped that.  also, while the crop was done nice and tight, it hurt the overall image size some.  This could have been a bit bigger and been more effective.</td>', 'a nice shot.  Was way to fuzzy for my liking though.  a run through unsharp mask would have helped that.  also, while the crop was done nice and tight, it hurt the overall image size some.  This could have been a bit bigger and been more effective.', '2003-03-05 01:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(229448, 13242, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very subtle difference between the white colors.  Works pretty well here I think.  But the pic is a little grainy for some reason.  Not sure why.</td>', 'Very subtle difference between the white colors.  Works pretty well here I think.  But the pic is a little grainy for some reason.  Not sure why.', '2003-03-05 01:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
