(229460, 13355, 6370, '<td valign="top">ncie picture.  the crop hurt your overall image size however -- made it a touch smaller than what compliments the picture.</td>', 'ncie picture.  the crop hurt your overall image size however -- made it a touch smaller than what compliments the picture.', '2003-03-05 01:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
