(229467, 13289, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very good, I love the red and white, with the silver thrown in.  One thing is, it looks like you should have rotated the pic to the right a few degrees.  But still an 8.</td>', 'Very good, I love the red and white, with the silver thrown in.  One thing is, it looks like you should have rotated the pic to the right a few degrees.  But still an 8.', '2003-03-05 01:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
