(229546, 13463, 772, '<td valign="top">the color is definitely strong in this photo.. the egg contrasts nicely with the environment... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'the color is definitely strong in this photo.. the egg contrasts nicely with the environment... good work :) - setzler', '2003-03-05 08:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
