(230177, 13471, 509, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you''ve heard enough about this being blurry.  That said, I like the positioning of the image in respect to the overall frame, but the blue bar in the upper left is distracting.  I''m not sure if hardwood floor would be the best background for this shot, maybe something that matches more with the pastal rabbit, just a suggestion.</td>', 'I''m sure you''ve heard enough about this being blurry.  That said, I like the positioning of the image in respect to the overall frame, but the blue bar in the upper left is distracting.  I''m not sure if hardwood floor would be the best background for this shot, maybe something that matches more with the pastal rabbit, just a suggestion.', '2003-03-05 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230178, 13386, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice color, I like how the egg matches the bark and debris in the treads</td>', 'Nice color, I like how the egg matches the bark and debris in the treads', '2003-03-05 23:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230180, 13494, 509, '<td valign="top">Wow....very nice.</td>', 'Wow....very nice.', '2003-03-05 23:44:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(230185, 13249, 509, '<td valign="top">The blue plate definitely works well to compliment the yellow, great use of color and a nice sharp focus! - 9 - Mav</td>', 'The blue plate definitely works well to compliment the yellow, great use of color and a nice sharp focus! - 9 - Mav', '2003-03-05 23:53:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(230189, 13237, 509, '<td valign="top">Nice work, it almost looks like it''s floating there, reminds me of the earth, albeit a little mis-shapen</td>', 'Nice work, it almost looks like it''s floating there, reminds me of the earth, albeit a little mis-shapen', '2003-03-05 23:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(230190, 13222, 6325, '<td valign="top">Lighting is pretty good - maybe some more on the eggs.</td>', 'Lighting is pretty good - maybe some more on the eggs.', '2003-03-05 23:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230196, 13263, 6325, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on Easter eggs. Coloring on the blue eggs is really nice.</td>', 'Interesting take on Easter eggs. Coloring on the blue eggs is really nice.', '2003-03-06 00:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230197, 13381, 6325, '<td valign="top">Good texture in the egg.</td>', 'Good texture in the egg.', '2003-03-06 00:06:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(230199, 13282, 6325, '<td valign="top">The shadow on the egg is great. The background fits. I don''t understand the spoon.</td>', 'The shadow on the egg is great. The background fits. I don''t understand the spoon.', '2003-03-06 00:12:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(230202, 13342, 6325, '<td valign="top">Cool. How did you manage this? Shooting through glass? Pretty tough.</td>', 'Cool. How did you manage this? Shooting through glass? Pretty tough.', '2003-03-06 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(230204, 13209, 6325, '<td valign="top">This works on several levels. Textures are exceptional.</td>', 'This works on several levels. Textures are exceptional.', '2003-03-06 00:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230205, 13322, 6325, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2003-03-06 00:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(230208, 13187, 6325, '<td valign="top">Original idea. Why the shiny surface?</td>', 'Original idea. Why the shiny surface?', '2003-03-06 00:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(230211, 13203, 5044, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. The  eggs look HUUUUGE! Great perspective.</td>', 'Excellent composition. The  eggs look HUUUUGE! Great perspective.', '2003-03-06 00:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(230212, 13289, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Excellent use of the reccuring pattern. Nice lighting too.</td>', 'Nice composition. Excellent use of the reccuring pattern. Nice lighting too.', '2003-03-06 00:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(230214, 13376, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Nice croping and composition.</td>', 'Nice capture. Nice croping and composition.', '2003-03-06 00:41:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(230215, 13321, 5044, '<td valign="top">Those are some HUGE salmon eggs. Nice reflections in the eggs, except we see the photographer as well.</td>', 'Those are some HUGE salmon eggs. Nice reflections in the eggs, except we see the photographer as well.', '2003-03-06 00:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230238, 13192, 4055, '<td valign="top">My favourite this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good.. A little harsch light from right but it´s not a big deal. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'My favourite this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good.. A little harsch light from right but it´s not a big deal. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.', '2003-03-06 03:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(230239, 13274, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good.. I had probably made it a little darker but that´s just me. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good.. I had probably made it a little darker but that´s just me. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.', '2003-03-06 03:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230240, 13203, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the sepia tone is good. An egg on a mirror holding your hand above, or what?. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the sepia tone is good. An egg on a mirror holding your hand above, or what?. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.', '2003-03-06 03:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(230241, 13501, 4055, '<td valign="top">One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.</td>', 'One of my favourites this week. Great composition. Perfect focus and the colours are good. Overall a very interesting shot that gets high score from me. Well done and good luck.', '2003-03-06 03:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(230284, 13386, 6458, '<td valign="top">*groan*<br/>Okay, so it made me smile once I finally got it.</td>', '*groan*Okay, so it made me smile once I finally got it.', '2003-03-06 06:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(230335, 13265, 4400, '<td valign="top">Very good idea-8pt</td>', 'Very good idea-8pt', '2003-03-06 08:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230343, 13237, 6870, '<td valign="top">Colorful and creative, I find this image stunning. Center is the right place for this, and your focus and sharpness is good. Well done!</td>', 'Colorful and creative, I find this image stunning. Center is the right place for this, and your focus and sharpness is good. Well done!', '2003-03-06 09:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230344, 13265, 6870, '<td valign="top">I find side by side comparison shots like this very difficult, but you pulled it off with some good balancing. Really clever idea. Lighting is great, too. A very pleasing shot to gaze at for a while.</td>', 'I find side by side comparison shots like this very difficult, but you pulled it off with some good balancing. Really clever idea. Lighting is great, too. A very pleasing shot to gaze at for a while.', '2003-03-06 09:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230345, 13266, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t konw how you did it, but this is a really fun, whimsical image that does much to brighten my day. Well composed and the lighting is terrific. Thanks!</td>', 'I don''t konw how you did it, but this is a really fun, whimsical image that does much to brighten my day. Well composed and the lighting is terrific. Thanks!', '2003-03-06 09:21:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(230346, 13321, 6870, '<td valign="top">Extremely pleasing colors here--and I''m partially colorblind! I find this a warm comfortable image. I can almost smell the eggs in their context. The light you captured is partially the key here, but you also chose good surroundings. Thanks for having your image appropriately in focus. I hope it does well! 10</td>', 'Extremely pleasing colors here--and I''m partially colorblind! I find this a warm comfortable image. I can almost smell the eggs in their context. The light you captured is partially the key here, but you also chose good surroundings. Thanks for having your image appropriately in focus. I hope it does well! 10', '2003-03-06 09:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(230348, 13376, 6870, '<td valign="top">Photography is all about light, and you''ve captured excellent light here! A very pleasing, warm image despite the frost. I think had you punched your shadows a bit more, it would have had even more of an impact. Nicely done! 9</td>', 'Photography is all about light, and you''ve captured excellent light here! A very pleasing, warm image despite the frost. I think had you punched your shadows a bit more, it would have had even more of an impact. Nicely done! 9', '2003-03-06 09:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230349, 13274, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ever since Blue Tonic folks have been doing this split image shot, but yours is a unique and playful twist--and very well executed. Thanks for a wonderful image! 10</td>', 'Ever since Blue Tonic folks have been doing this split image shot, but yours is a unique and playful twist--and very well executed. Thanks for a wonderful image! 10', '2003-03-06 09:26:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(230351, 13516, 6870, '<td valign="top">I took a lot of glowing egg shots, too, but I didn''t think to crack the shell! Well, you did and it makes all the difference! Stunning light, and you still managed to keep it in focus and pretty sharp. I like the mood it evokes. 10</td>', 'I took a lot of glowing egg shots, too, but I didn''t think to crack the shell! Well, you did and it makes all the difference! Stunning light, and you still managed to keep it in focus and pretty sharp. I like the mood it evokes. 10', '2003-03-06 09:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(230352, 13276, 6536, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Very creative. 9.</td>', 'Good shot. Very creative. 9.', '2003-03-06 09:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(230353, 13365, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice coloring &amp; contrast. Good cropping. 7.</td>', 'Nice coloring & contrast. Good cropping. 7.', '2003-03-06 09:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230354, 13417, 6536, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Perfect coloring &amp; cropping. Maybe a different title would have been better for it. 10.</td>', 'Excellent shot. Perfect coloring & cropping. Maybe a different title would have been better for it. 10.', '2003-03-06 09:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(230355, 13291, 6230, '<td valign="top">Overexposed portion is too glaring.</td>', 'Overexposed portion is too glaring.', '2003-03-06 09:32:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230356, 13129, 6536, '<td valign="top">Good shot. I like the red background. I think it needs to be a little bit more in focus. 8.</td>', 'Good shot. I like the red background. I think it needs to be a little bit more in focus. 8.', '2003-03-06 09:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(230357, 13203, 6536, '<td valign="top">How are you holding up the eggs? Otherwise excellent shot. Perfect cropping &amp; coloring. 10.</td>', 'How are you holding up the eggs? Otherwise excellent shot. Perfect cropping & coloring. 10.', '2003-03-06 09:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(230358, 13345, 6230, '<td valign="top">Back portion is not in focus. Overall focus is soft. Too much back lighting and front of leaf is too dark. Good idea, though. Simple and colourful, eventhough there is only 4 colours including white.</td>', 'Back portion is not in focus. Overall focus is soft. Too much back lighting and front of leaf is too dark. Good idea, though. Simple and colourful, eventhough there is only 4 colours including white.', '2003-03-06 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(230359, 13511, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Good detail &amp; contrast. Maybe you should try this in black &amp; white. 9.</td>', 'Great shot. Good detail & contrast. Maybe you should try this in black & white. 9.', '2003-03-06 09:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(230361, 13496, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but it looks too much like a snapshot. I think it would take alot more setup to get this to work properly.</td>', 'Nice idea, but it looks too much like a snapshot. I think it would take alot more setup to get this to work properly.', '2003-03-06 09:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(230362, 13380, 6536, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Perfect contrast &amp; cropping. 10.</td>', 'Great shot. Perfect contrast & cropping. 10.', '2003-03-06 09:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230363, 13259, 6230, '<td valign="top">Egg is oval in shape, the egg in the picture is positioned in such a way that the perspective is round. It doesn''t look like an egg.</td>', 'Egg is oval in shape, the egg in the picture is positioned in such a way that the perspective is round. It doesn''t look like an egg.', '2003-03-06 09:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230364, 13300, 917, '<td valign="top">Good eggs. Tthe hammer head is overexposed on one side, under at the other. Perhaps a reflector to get some light back from this side would have helped.</td>', 'Good eggs. Tthe hammer head is overexposed on one side, under at the other. Perhaps a reflector to get some light back from this side would have helped.', '2003-03-06 09:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(230365, 13306, 3419, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition, lighting, and subject matter. Well done!</td>', 'Beautiful composition, lighting, and subject matter. Well done!', '2003-03-06 09:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(230366, 13446, 6230, '<td valign="top">Where''s your other leg? Looks unnatural. Good idea!!!</td>', 'Where''s your other leg? Looks unnatural. Good idea!!!', '2003-03-06 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(230368, 13503, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple. It may look better flipped over to put the high end on the left.</td>', 'Nice and simple. It may look better flipped over to put the high end on the left.', '2003-03-06 09:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(230369, 13268, 6230, '<td valign="top">Impact will be greater if the background colour is lighter. Focusing is a little out (soft).</td>', 'Impact will be greater if the background colour is lighter. Focusing is a little out (soft).', '2003-03-06 09:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(230371, 13499, 917, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. To eliminate the glare, turn the flash off, and brace the camera against something. Maybe a cardboard cutout cell would give you more control over composition.</td>', 'Nice idea. To eliminate the glare, turn the flash off, and brace the camera against something. Maybe a cardboard cutout cell would give you more control over composition.', '2003-03-06 09:54:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230373, 13383, 6230, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting control, lots of reflections on egg''s surface. Focus is also out. Colourful, good idea.</td>', 'Poor lighting control, lots of reflections on egg''s surface. Focus is also out. Colourful, good idea.', '2003-03-06 09:57:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230374, 13424, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo, this "egg drop" capture. Great imagination, nicely captured.</td>', 'Very cool photo, this "egg drop" capture. Great imagination, nicely captured.', '2003-03-06 09:58:43.000000', NULL, 1);
