(230561, 13391, 5266, '<td valign="top">LOL!!  Wonderful concept!!  The egg-spression is priceless!!  You made me laugh, so you get a 9</td>', 'LOL!!  Wonderful concept!!  The egg-spression is priceless!!  You made me laugh, so you get a 9', '2003-03-06 14:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230562, 13403, 5266, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!!  I really like the colors here - I can''t imagine how many eggs it took to get the hole right.  Nice lighting.  8</td>', 'Neat idea!!  I really like the colors here - I can''t imagine how many eggs it took to get the hole right.  Nice lighting.  8', '2003-03-06 14:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230564, 13376, 5266, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the "lace".  I like the effect on the brown egg.  Good choice of colors here.  And the lighting is wonderful.</td>', 'Great detail in the "lace".  I like the effect on the brown egg.  Good choice of colors here.  And the lighting is wonderful.', '2003-03-06 14:46:44.000000', NULL, 1),
