(230566, 13348, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent shot... I love the use of color here... the reflections are also great :) - setzler</td>', 'This is an excellent shot... I love the use of color here... the reflections are also great :) - setzler', '2003-03-06 14:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
