(230576, 13449, 5266, '<td valign="top">Perfect color matching!!  So cute - I just sort of wish you didn''t pull the peeps apart (I can see their little marshmallow guts)  8</td>', 'Perfect color matching!!  So cute - I just sort of wish you didn''t pull the peeps apart (I can see their little marshmallow guts)  8', '2003-03-06 15:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
