(230582, 13192, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is real - but if it is congratulations on havig that much patience!!  I love the grasses and shadows in this photo.  7</td>', 'I don''t know if this is real - but if it is congratulations on havig that much patience!!  I love the grasses and shadows in this photo.  7', '2003-03-06 15:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(230583, 13399, 5266, '<td valign="top">I love the DOF in this photo.  Nice texture in the eggshells.  7</td>', 'I love the DOF in this photo.  Nice texture in the eggshells.  7', '2003-03-06 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(230584, 13283, 5266, '<td valign="top">An egg torture device!!  Interesting idea.  I like the old fashioned looking machine.  The DOF is nice, as well as the angle you have chosen to use.  7</td>', 'An egg torture device!!  Interesting idea.  I like the old fashioned looking machine.  The DOF is nice, as well as the angle you have chosen to use.  7', '2003-03-06 15:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(230585, 13411, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yuk, this is a great shot :-) I hate the glibbery stuff in eggs! Good lighting and the mirror effect is cool. I only find it a tad grainy, especially at the top of the photo, but otherwise an image you can be proud of.</td>', 'Yuk, this is a great shot :-) I hate the glibbery stuff in eggs! Good lighting and the mirror effect is cool. I only find it a tad grainy, especially at the top of the photo, but otherwise an image you can be proud of.', '2003-03-06 15:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(230586, 13194, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good mirror shot. You could almost turn it 180 degrees and no one would no the difference. Except that the lighting might be a little too harsh coming from the right on the top. Good choice of border.</td>', 'Good mirror shot. You could almost turn it 180 degrees and no one would no the difference. Except that the lighting might be a little too harsh coming from the right on the top. Good choice of border.', '2003-03-06 15:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(230588, 13244, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is original, and you did it very well. The lighting is very good here, there are no signs of hot spots anywhere.</td>', 'This is original, and you did it very well. The lighting is very good here, there are no signs of hot spots anywhere.', '2003-03-06 15:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230589, 13363, 5728, '<td valign="top">All I have seen so far are normal hen''s eggs and this is the first photo I have seen using different eggs. Good idea, I am surprised no one else has used them.  The background fits perfectly and the darkness only enhances this image.</td>', 'All I have seen so far are normal hen''s eggs and this is the first photo I have seen using different eggs. Good idea, I am surprised no one else has used them.  The background fits perfectly and the darkness only enhances this image.', '2003-03-06 15:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
