(230606, 13279, 6536, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great coloring &amp; contrast. I would like to see a little more detail on the eggs. 8.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great coloring & contrast. I would like to see a little more detail on the eggs. 8.', '2003-03-06 15:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
