(230637, 13522, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting use of light and shadow... also an interesting choice not to light the front of the egg a little more also.. - setzler</td>', 'interesting use of light and shadow... also an interesting choice not to light the front of the egg a little more also.. - setzler', '2003-03-06 16:38:58.000000', NULL, 1),
