(230664, 13448, 772, '<td valign="top">good composition on this shot, but the theme just doesn''t grab me.. maybe it would be stronger if the egg was fully visible and not in a container to make it look round.. - setzler</td>', 'good composition on this shot, but the theme just doesn''t grab me.. maybe it would be stronger if the egg was fully visible and not in a container to make it look round.. - setzler', '2003-03-06 17:25:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(230670, 13471, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute bunny....but so many photo issues - focus - neither the egg nore the bunny look to be in focus.  Lighting - left side of bunny seems washed out.  Cropping - O.K., but the blue line in the upper left corner is not a good thing.  I''m not certain, but I think I see jpeg compression artifacts (too much compression or resizing all at once).  The overall image seems small.  3 Swash</td>', 'Cute bunny....but so many photo issues - focus - neither the egg nore the bunny look to be in focus.  Lighting - left side of bunny seems washed out.  Cropping - O.K., but the blue line in the upper left corner is not a good thing.  I''m not certain, but I think I see jpeg compression artifacts (too much compression or resizing all at once).  The overall image seems small.  3 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230673, 13499, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute idea!  Nice color, but overall seems grainy and not sharp.  Flash reflection on the white is pretty nasty.  4 Swash</td>', 'Cute idea!  Nice color, but overall seems grainy and not sharp.  Flash reflection on the white is pretty nasty.  4 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(230674, 13275, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot.  Seems on the pale side (you might want to try some color saturation, it''s lega and does a world of good)  The egg must be moving, so it''s clarity isn''t very high.  Details of the sheet say the focus is very good, but with the cat legnthwise to the camera, much is out of focus.  5 Swash</td>', 'Cute shot.  Seems on the pale side (you might want to try some color saturation, it''s lega and does a world of good)  The egg must be moving, so it''s clarity isn''t very high.  Details of the sheet say the focus is very good, but with the cat legnthwise to the camera, much is out of focus.  5 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:18:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(230675, 13326, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well done photo.  Color and focus are very good.  Few (other than I) quote the site rules for Other People''s Art, but I do.  This is OPA w/o much or any modification.  I''m sorry, but I cannot give a high score to OPA, incorporate other items (even art/craft items), please.  5 Swash</td>', 'Very well done photo.  Color and focus are very good.  Few (other than I) quote the site rules for Other People''s Art, but I do.  This is OPA w/o much or any modification.  I''m sorry, but I cannot give a high score to OPA, incorporate other items (even art/craft items), please.  5 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:22:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230680, 13325, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, but the egg seems to have suffered.  The edges aren''t very strong (focus?)  and the background isn''t to my liking (sorry).  5 Swash</td>', 'Interesting effect, but the egg seems to have suffered.  The edges aren''t very strong (focus?)  and the background isn''t to my liking (sorry).  5 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230681, 13186, 1005, '<td valign="top">It''s an egg!  Focus seems a little off sharp, background is a littel too similarly colored, cropping seems overly tight and uneven, and the shadow is a bit grainy.  5 Swash</td>', 'It''s an egg!  Focus seems a little off sharp, background is a littel too similarly colored, cropping seems overly tight and uneven, and the shadow is a bit grainy.  5 Swash', '2003-03-06 18:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(230682, 13319, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting egg idea :)  I remember doing this experiment way back when in grade school... nice job with the lighting also.. the eggs are nice and white :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting egg idea :)  I remember doing this experiment way back when in grade school... nice job with the lighting also.. the eggs are nice and white :) - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230683, 13458, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting abstract... i think a small rotation of the egg to create a diagonal would be strong also... - setzler</td>', 'interesting abstract... i think a small rotation of the egg to create a diagonal would be strong also... - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:39:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(230684, 13485, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful composition... the only thing that i think would improve this would be to have some sort of visible base so it doesn''t appear to be floating in space :) - setzler</td>', 'beautiful composition... the only thing that i think would improve this would be to have some sort of visible base so it doesn''t appear to be floating in space :) - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:40:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230685, 13281, 772, '<td valign="top">nice composition... good job with the lighting and color also :) - setzler</td>', 'nice composition... good job with the lighting and color also :) - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230687, 13194, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent work with the reflections... i really didn''t think anyone would be able to work a flower into this challenge effectively :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent work with the reflections... i really didn''t think anyone would be able to work a flower into this challenge effectively :) - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(230688, 13292, 5418, '<td valign="top">A nice picture, but I should have seen this coming. Enough with the symbolism already! :)</td>', 'A nice picture, but I should have seen this coming. Enough with the symbolism already! :)', '2003-03-06 18:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(230689, 13334, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, but I think a diagonal orientation could possibly make it stronger and add some more visual impact... - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot, but I think a diagonal orientation could possibly make it stronger and add some more visual impact... - setzler', '2003-03-06 18:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230692, 13303, 5418, '<td valign="top">The best before stamp is a bit distracting. Nice clarity though!</td>', 'The best before stamp is a bit distracting. Nice clarity though!', '2003-03-06 18:45:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(230696, 13188, 2158, '<td valign="top">Personally I think this loses something in black &amp; white.</td>', 'Personally I think this loses something in black & white.', '2003-03-06 19:24:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(230698, 13187, 5728, '<td valign="top">You''ve created an excellent image here, the mirror effect is wonderful. The toning does so much for this photo, this is one you can be pround of.</td>', 'You''ve created an excellent image here, the mirror effect is wonderful. The toning does so much for this photo, this is one you can be pround of.', '2003-03-06 19:35:52.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(230699, 13178, 5728, '<td valign="top">You have given a simple photo so much impact. The lighting and the crop is optimal, and the fact you didn''t border it was a good choice.</td>', 'You have given a simple photo so much impact. The lighting and the crop is optimal, and the fact you didn''t border it was a good choice.', '2003-03-06 19:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(230700, 13413, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice skyline - I like the shape of the photo .. out of the ordinary.</td>', 'Nice skyline - I like the shape of the photo .. out of the ordinary.', '2003-03-06 19:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230701, 13511, 5728, '<td valign="top">This little guy gets around :-) I particularly like the way you have used him in this photo. You have cropped him wonderfully! The shadow is very effective. Good one.</td>', 'This little guy gets around :-) I particularly like the way you have used him in this photo. You have cropped him wonderfully! The shadow is very effective. Good one.', '2003-03-06 19:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(230702, 13249, 5266, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast of the blue plate against the yolk.  I like the bubbles.</td>', 'Nice contrast of the blue plate against the yolk.  I like the bubbles.', '2003-03-06 19:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(230703, 13382, 5266, '<td valign="top">You have WAY TOO MUCH time on your hands!!!  Stapling together an egg??  WOW!!  Great texture on the shell - nice brown egg/black eggcup combination.  I can''t believe you did this - incredible!!  9</td>', 'You have WAY TOO MUCH time on your hands!!!  Stapling together an egg??  WOW!!  Great texture on the shell - nice brown egg/black eggcup combination.  I can''t believe you did this - incredible!!  9', '2003-03-06 19:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230704, 13424, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow! You captured this one well. Those two bubbles at the front give this shot so much impact! I would print this one.</td>', 'Wow! You captured this one well. Those two bubbles at the front give this shot so much impact! I would print this one.', '2003-03-06 19:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230705, 13445, 5266, '<td valign="top">LOL!!! Great title - good expression on the bird - looks quite proud and concerned at the same time!!  Lighting is a bit harsh/background not great, but I like the overall photo.  7</td>', 'LOL!!! Great title - good expression on the bird - looks quite proud and concerned at the same time!!  Lighting is a bit harsh/background not great, but I like the overall photo.  7', '2003-03-06 19:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(230708, 13300, 5266, '<td valign="top">And the big egg would be???  LOL!!  I live in one of the little eggs and our warships just headed off.  Original idea - nice lighting.</td>', 'And the big egg would be???  LOL!!  I live in one of the little eggs and our warships just headed off.  Original idea - nice lighting.', '2003-03-06 19:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(230709, 13467, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors here, this is a photo I would put on my wall. The contrast is excellent. The lighting is optimal, I love the textures.</td>', 'Wonderful colors here, this is a photo I would put on my wall. The contrast is excellent. The lighting is optimal, I love the textures.', '2003-03-06 19:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(230711, 13286, 5266, '<td valign="top">I didn''t think the ham was supposed to be green, but at least this is an original idea.  Are those really eggs?  They sort of look like tomatoes on something white.  The reflections on the cutlery is a bit too bright.</td>', 'I didn''t think the ham was supposed to be green, but at least this is an original idea.  Are those really eggs?  They sort of look like tomatoes on something white.  The reflections on the cutlery is a bit too bright.', '2003-03-06 19:45:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(230712, 13449, 5728, '<td valign="top">When I was browsing through this week''s challenge, this is the thumbmail that struck out at me the most. When I clicked on it I wasn''t disappointed. The colours are awesome, and the composition even better. Perfect capture!</td>', 'When I was browsing through this week''s challenge, this is the thumbmail that struck out at me the most. When I clicked on it I wasn''t disappointed. The colours are awesome, and the composition even better. Perfect capture!', '2003-03-06 19:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(230715, 13363, 2158, '<td valign="top">Personally I''d rather have cropped off the red section at the top because that black middle part seems to leave the top and bottom disconnected.</td>', 'Personally I''d rather have cropped off the red section at the top because that black middle part seems to leave the top and bottom disconnected.', '2003-03-06 20:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(230716, 13273, 7131, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of color, close-up photography!  The texture of the egg really adds to the overall effect.</td>', 'Excellent use of color, close-up photography!  The texture of the egg really adds to the overall effect.', '2003-03-06 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(230720, 13355, 6536, '<td valign="top">Good cropping &amp; lighting. You may want to try this at a different angle.</td>', 'Good cropping & lighting. You may want to try this at a different angle.', '2003-03-06 20:30:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(230722, 13481, 6536, '<td valign="top">I like this shot. This is a nice food still life. Great lighting &amp; cropping. 10.</td>', 'I like this shot. This is a nice food still life. Great lighting & cropping. 10.', '2003-03-06 20:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(230723, 13192, 2752, '<td valign="top">the composition is great..the lighting is gorgeous...the "nest" bold in the front and fading into the shadows creates good depth..(10)</td>', 'the composition is great..the lighting is gorgeous...the "nest" bold in the front and fading into the shadows creates good depth..(10)', '2003-03-06 20:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230724, 13485, 2752, '<td valign="top">very crisp and sharp composition..the colored eggs not overpowering the basket.  I especially like the way the dry tendrels finish the picture...(10)</td>', 'very crisp and sharp composition..the colored eggs not overpowering the basket.  I especially like the way the dry tendrels finish the picture...(10)', '2003-03-06 20:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(230726, 13309, 2752, '<td valign="top">a beautiful study in white...the shadow of the egg and frame compliment each other well..(9)</td>', 'a beautiful study in white...the shadow of the egg and frame compliment each other well..(9)', '2003-03-06 20:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
