(230843, 13309, 6325, '<td valign="top">I like the shades and textures together. Nice sparkle in the snow. I owuld have scored it higher without the border.</td>', 'I like the shades and textures together. Nice sparkle in the snow. I owuld have scored it higher without the border.', '2003-03-06 22:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230845, 13499, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is a cleaver idea but it is just too blurry for me. It looks like you are too close for the camera to focus. I wonder how this photo would look if it were lighted from inside of the prison???</td>', 'This is a cleaver idea but it is just too blurry for me. It looks like you are too close for the camera to focus. I wonder how this photo would look if it were lighted from inside of the prison???', '2003-03-06 22:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
