(230848, 13523, 1135, '<td valign="top">You can go as big as 640 X 640 so I wonder why this photo is so small. Maybe it''s your camera? Sharper focus one the eggshells would help too. Good Luck!</td>', 'You can go as big as 640 X 640 so I wonder why this photo is so small. Maybe it''s your camera? Sharper focus one the eggshells would help too. Good Luck!', '2003-03-06 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(230849, 13363, 3306, '<td valign="top">nice texture.</td>', 'nice texture.', '2003-03-06 22:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(230850, 13503, 6325, '<td valign="top">You capture a nice shine on the egg. Well done.</td>', 'You capture a nice shine on the egg. Well done.', '2003-03-06 22:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(230851, 13193, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very cool setup and I like the colors. I wish you had made the photo bigger; you can go up to 640 X 640, which really helps in WOW department. The photo is just a little too dark in the lower left and it could be a bit sharper. I still like it though. Good Luck!</td>', 'Very cool setup and I like the colors. I wish you had made the photo bigger; you can go up to 640 X 640, which really helps in WOW department. The photo is just a little too dark in the lower left and it could be a bit sharper. I still like it though. Good Luck!', '2003-03-06 22:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230852, 13471, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice color and composition. The Focus is a bit soft and it would have more WOW if the photo were bigger. You can go up to 640 X 640. Good Luck!</td>', 'Nice color and composition. The Focus is a bit soft and it would have more WOW if the photo were bigger. You can go up to 640 X 640. Good Luck!', '2003-03-06 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230856, 13353, 1135, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft focus on this one. The only thing that would make it better is if it was bigger. You are allowed up to 640 X 640. Good Luck!</td>', 'I really like the soft focus on this one. The only thing that would make it better is if it was bigger. You are allowed up to 640 X 640. Good Luck!', '2003-03-06 22:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230858, 13133, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice tecture in the eggs and dof works well. Did you try cropping out the table surface and leaving just the tops of the eggs?</td>', 'Nice tecture in the eggs and dof works well. Did you try cropping out the table surface and leaving just the tops of the eggs?', '2003-03-06 22:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230859, 13316, 1135, '<td valign="top">I really like the background on this one. It looks like the egg is just a little over exposed but I still like it. Good Job!</td>', 'I really like the background on this one. It looks like the egg is just a little over exposed but I still like it. Good Job!', '2003-03-06 22:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(230862, 13321, 6325, '<td valign="top">Nice shine on the eggs. Doing a little fishing? Don''t I recognize the lattice in the egg from the Leading Lines cahllenge? I think the simple eggs and jar without the shoe whould have been a better composition.</td>', 'Nice shine on the eggs. Doing a little fishing? Don''t I recognize the lattice in the egg from the Leading Lines cahllenge? I think the simple eggs and jar without the shoe whould have been a better composition.', '2003-03-06 22:52:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(230863, 13355, 1135, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot but my old eyes are having a hard time seeing it. You can go up to 640 X 640 and a bigger photo is bound to get more attention. ''Still'' it''s a nice shot. Good Luck!</td>', 'This is a great shot but my old eyes are having a hard time seeing it. You can go up to 640 X 640 and a bigger photo is bound to get more attention. ''Still'' it''s a nice shot. Good Luck!', '2003-03-06 22:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
