(230870, 13378, 6325, '<td valign="top">Took me for ever to catch on.</td>', 'Took me for ever to catch on.', '2003-03-06 23:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230883, 13498, 6325, '<td valign="top">This is exactly the same set up as "Humpty Dumpty Sat in a Cell". (Except for the eye in the back.) What gives? This one is exposed a little better than the other one.</td>', 'This is exactly the same set up as "Humpty Dumpty Sat in a Cell". (Except for the eye in the back.) What gives? This one is exposed a little better than the other one.', '2003-03-06 23:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(230884, 13392, 6325, '<td valign="top">I ws looking at the reflections and noticed you - hello. The top egg is interesting in that you can see the other eggs - maybe that was the better shot.</td>', 'I ws looking at the reflections and noticed you - hello. The top egg is interesting in that you can see the other eggs - maybe that was the better shot.', '2003-03-06 23:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(230918, 13434, 3697, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and great color. I would like to see a larger version of the picture as well.</td>', 'Nice composition and great color. I would like to see a larger version of the picture as well.', '2003-03-06 23:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(230921, 13376, 6182, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful!    I love the effect that you got here...it''s very well thought out and well done...good eye for the unusual.</td>', 'This is really beautiful!    I love the effect that you got here...it''s very well thought out and well done...good eye for the unusual.', '2003-03-06 23:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(230923, 13233, 6182, '<td valign="top">fun idea...interesting placement although it''s very unusual and i keep trying to figure out what that is that the egg is sitting on.   i like the way the steps look grainy.</td>', 'fun idea...interesting placement although it''s very unusual and i keep trying to figure out what that is that the egg is sitting on.   i like the way the steps look grainy.', '2003-03-06 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(230926, 13308, 6182, '<td valign="top">Nice photo...a border would help hold this together a little better...the branches tend to draw your eyes to the outside edges and make it look like an odd shape without borders to hold it in.   i really like the contrast of the egg against those beautiful colors...nice light also.</td>', 'Nice photo...a border would help hold this together a little better...the branches tend to draw your eyes to the outside edges and make it look like an odd shape without borders to hold it in.   i really like the contrast of the egg against those beautiful colors...nice light also.', '2003-03-06 23:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230930, 13392, 6182, '<td valign="top">interesting idea...i love silver!   i think i would have set up that one egg with a different orienation so that you don''t see that hole in it or at least so that it''s not so prominent.    nice reflections and good lighting i think.      I like the cropping on this picture because it definitely places the emphasis on the eggs.</td>', 'interesting idea...i love silver!   i think i would have set up that one egg with a different orienation so that you don''t see that hole in it or at least so that it''s not so prominent.    nice reflections and good lighting i think.      I like the cropping on this picture because it definitely places the emphasis on the eggs.', '2003-03-06 23:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(230932, 13510, 6182, '<td valign="top">interesting idea...the title is very cool but i can''t for the life of me figure out what it has to do with the photo.    i like the patterny effect created here....i think you need a border to hold it together!</td>', 'interesting idea...the title is very cool but i can''t for the life of me figure out what it has to do with the photo.    i like the patterny effect created here....i think you need a border to hold it together!', '2003-03-07 00:01:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(230936, 13289, 6182, '<td valign="top">Very fun props!  and i love the color choice....it would be better with just three of the little holders i guarantee.    whenever you do groupings, use odd numbers of things...it''s a definite rule in arranging flowers and it definitely works better in situations like this also...i would have left out the one on the far right.</td>', 'Very fun props!  and i love the color choice....it would be better with just three of the little holders i guarantee.    whenever you do groupings, use odd numbers of things...it''s a definite rule in arranging flowers and it definitely works better in situations like this also...i would have left out the one on the far right.', '2003-03-07 00:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(230941, 13494, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea and well composed. The eggs seem slightly out of focus in deference to the machinery; perhaps it should be reversed if given a choice.</td>', 'Interesting idea and well composed. The eggs seem slightly out of focus in deference to the machinery; perhaps it should be reversed if given a choice.', '2003-03-07 00:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(230943, 13232, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIfty textures and a fun image. B/W is a good choice for this photo to really punch the textures and grays. I wish egg were as focused as the clamp. Nice work.</td>', 'NIfty textures and a fun image. B/W is a good choice for this photo to really punch the textures and grays. I wish egg were as focused as the clamp. Nice work.', '2003-03-07 00:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(230944, 13386, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the egg in this photo, and everything is so sharp (everything that needs to be). Nice job.</td>', 'I like the placement of the egg in this photo, and everything is so sharp (everything that needs to be). Nice job.', '2003-03-07 00:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(230945, 13365, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really bizarre, delightful image. good cropping and placemen off egg in frame. Just a tad out of focus when it probably should be in focus.</td>', 'Really bizarre, delightful image. good cropping and placemen off egg in frame. Just a tad out of focus when it probably should be in focus.', '2003-03-07 00:22:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(230949, 13397, 6870, '<td valign="top">The unique perspective and rich tones of this image ranked it pretty high for me.</td>', 'The unique perspective and rich tones of this image ranked it pretty high for me.', '2003-03-07 00:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(230950, 13482, 6870, '<td valign="top">NIce composition and warm, cuddly colors that match the textures well. The twigs are in such focus; I wish the egg had such clarity, too.</td>', 'NIce composition and warm, cuddly colors that match the textures well. The twigs are in such focus; I wish the egg had such clarity, too.', '2003-03-07 00:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(230952, 13279, 6870, '<td valign="top">Funky idea and lovely lighting and colors.</td>', 'Funky idea and lovely lighting and colors.', '2003-03-07 00:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230953, 13216, 6870, '<td valign="top">Clear, sharp and interesting. The only distraction is the reflections on the bottom half of the eggs.</td>', 'Clear, sharp and interesting. The only distraction is the reflections on the bottom half of the eggs.', '2003-03-07 00:26:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(230955, 13263, 6870, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand the title,but I love the rich colors and sharp focus of the central eggs.</td>', 'I don''t really understand the title,but I love the rich colors and sharp focus of the central eggs.', '2003-03-07 00:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(230957, 13300, 6870, '<td valign="top">My fellow political/symbolic photographer! Well done. Symbolism is clear, to me at least, and the composition, lighting and shadows compliment it well.</td>', 'My fellow political/symbolic photographer! Well done. Symbolism is clear, to me at least, and the composition, lighting and shadows compliment it well.', '2003-03-07 00:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(230958, 13373, 6870, '<td valign="top">Placing the egg high in the frame works well for this image. Clear, sharp and interesting!</td>', 'Placing the egg high in the frame works well for this image. Clear, sharp and interesting!', '2003-03-07 00:30:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(230961, 13215, 6870, '<td valign="top">A really engaging concept: so subtle, and I love how the egg disappears to the right.</td>', 'A really engaging concept: so subtle, and I love how the egg disappears to the right.', '2003-03-07 00:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(230962, 13403, 6870, '<td valign="top">Really nice light captured here.</td>', 'Really nice light captured here.', '2003-03-07 00:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(230963, 13361, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure some are critical of you not having a real "egg" here, but I really applaud your pushing of the boundaries: and with such a well composed, delightful image. It makes me happy to look at it. It''ll be one of my favorites when the challenge is done.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure some are critical of you not having a real "egg" here, but I really applaud your pushing of the boundaries: and with such a well composed, delightful image. It makes me happy to look at it. It''ll be one of my favorites when the challenge is done.', '2003-03-07 00:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(230972, 13473, 4767, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject.  It looks very difficult to illuminate to catch all the nuances.  I hope you continue to try to capture the elusive delicacy of it.  The harsh light under the plate distracts, I''d suggest a tighter crop there.  Shoot this in natural light, it cries for another shoot.</td>', 'An interesting subject.  It looks very difficult to illuminate to catch all the nuances.  I hope you continue to try to capture the elusive delicacy of it.  The harsh light under the plate distracts, I''d suggest a tighter crop there.  Shoot this in natural light, it cries for another shoot.', '2003-03-07 01:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(230976, 13286, 4767, '<td valign="top">Would you eat them on a plate?  If the plate''s as dark as Fate?</td>', 'Would you eat them on a plate?  If the plate''s as dark as Fate?', '2003-03-07 01:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(230977, 13495, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good focus.  The lighting is inconsistent, it''s a little darker in the lower part of the picture.</td>', 'Good focus.  The lighting is inconsistent, it''s a little darker in the lower part of the picture.', '2003-03-07 01:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(230978, 13356, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the No Cracking Zone!  But who''s on top of the body shop?</td>', 'I like the No Cracking Zone!  But who''s on top of the body shop?', '2003-03-07 01:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(230979, 13381, 4767, '<td valign="top">Show us out takes please!</td>', 'Show us out takes please!', '2003-03-07 01:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(230980, 13430, 6172, '<td valign="top">The lighting is dark and the front of the picture is out of focus.</td>', 'The lighting is dark and the front of the picture is out of focus.', '2003-03-07 01:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(230982, 13276, 4767, '<td valign="top">I saw him at the Broncos/Niners game last year!!!</td>', 'I saw him at the Broncos/Niners game last year!!!', '2003-03-07 01:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(230983, 13435, 4767, '<td valign="top">Think I saw this in Beauty and the Beast, didn''t I?</td>', 'Think I saw this in Beauty and the Beast, didn''t I?', '2003-03-07 01:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(230984, 13379, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very simple, but nice colors, focus, lighting and composition.</td>', 'Very simple, but nice colors, focus, lighting and composition.', '2003-03-07 01:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(230985, 13306, 4767, '<td valign="top">I like the picture, but think the border weakens the image</td>', 'I like the picture, but think the border weakens the image', '2003-03-07 01:24:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(230986, 13321, 4767, '<td valign="top">SUSHI?  bait?  interesting refelections!</td>', 'SUSHI?  bait?  interesting refelections!', '2003-03-07 01:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(230987, 13290, 6172, '<td valign="top">Good concept.  The picture looks like the top is larger than the bottom, but I''m sure that''s optical illusion.  My only gripe is that the lighting is not very good on the front lower egg.</td>', 'Good concept.  The picture looks like the top is larger than the bottom, but I''m sure that''s optical illusion.  My only gripe is that the lighting is not very good on the front lower egg.', '2003-03-07 01:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(230988, 13379, 4767, '<td valign="top">Wonderful light!  Such soft shadows and the intact egg is so delicate!  The yolk feels almost out of place here... and I wonder where the rest of the white went.</td>', 'Wonderful light!  Such soft shadows and the intact egg is so delicate!  The yolk feels almost out of place here... and I wonder where the rest of the white went.', '2003-03-07 01:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(230990, 13482, 6172, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  My only problem is, that is a chicken egg, right?  Chickens don''t lay their eggs in such places, so the shot looks a little fakey.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  My only problem is, that is a chicken egg, right?  Chickens don''t lay their eggs in such places, so the shot looks a little fakey.', '2003-03-07 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(230991, 13259, 4767, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen Hens and Chicks before, but THIS is ridiculous!  ;)</td>', 'I''ve seen Hens and Chicks before, but THIS is ridiculous!  ;)', '2003-03-07 01:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(230992, 13215, 4767, '<td valign="top">I LIKE subtle lighting! NICE!</td>', 'I LIKE subtle lighting! NICE!', '2003-03-07 01:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(230993, 13216, 6172, '<td valign="top">Would give higher score, but there is glare on the top of each egg.  What is reflected in the eggs?  It''s distracting.</td>', 'Would give higher score, but there is glare on the top of each egg.  What is reflected in the eggs?  It''s distracting.', '2003-03-07 01:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(230997, 13447, 4767, '<td valign="top">Photography is good, concept is unique; I recommend you avoid medical illustration as a career option.</td>', 'Photography is good, concept is unique; I recommend you avoid medical illustration as a career option.', '2003-03-07 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(230999, 13176, 6172, '<td valign="top">You''d have been better off cropping more of the statue and showing the whole egg.</td>', 'You''d have been better off cropping more of the statue and showing the whole egg.', '2003-03-07 01:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(231003, 13265, 4767, '<td valign="top">LOL!  Good lighting, bet it wasn''t easy to achieve, was it?  The silver reflects, the eggs don''t.  wow.  good work.</td>', 'LOL!  Good lighting, bet it wasn''t easy to achieve, was it?  The silver reflects, the eggs don''t.  wow.  good work.', '2003-03-07 01:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(231010, 13425, 4767, '<td valign="top">Interesting.   and for your next meal you had... a friatta?  An omelette?</td>', 'Interesting.   and for your next meal you had... a friatta?  An omelette?', '2003-03-07 01:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(231015, 13341, 4767, '<td valign="top">I wanta come to your house for breakfast.  Eggs at my house are BORING.</td>', 'I wanta come to your house for breakfast.  Eggs at my house are BORING.', '2003-03-07 01:52:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231019, 13402, 4767, '<td valign="top">Actually,  Russian Easter eggs are MUCH nicer than these, but some have flowers KINDA like on the costume of these Babushkas...</td>', 'Actually,  Russian Easter eggs are MUCH nicer than these, but some have flowers KINDA like on the costume of these Babushkas...', '2003-03-07 01:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(231020, 13421, 4767, '<td valign="top">more cracked than shattered, isn''t it?  Well shot!</td>', 'more cracked than shattered, isn''t it?  Well shot!', '2003-03-07 01:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(231028, 13365, 4767, '<td valign="top">O please say the background is not a human torso.... and not bad jokes were contemplated....</td>', 'O please say the background is not a human torso.... and not bad jokes were contemplated....', '2003-03-07 02:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(231030, 13446, 4767, '<td valign="top">answer?  feathers.  I hope.</td>', 'answer?  feathers.  I hope.', '2003-03-07 02:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231032, 13294, 4767, '<td valign="top">love the photo.  hate the frame.</td>', 'love the photo.  hate the frame.', '2003-03-07 02:20:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(231054, 13203, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very unusual perspective: were you dropping the eggs at your camera, or down to the hand? I like the use of light yellow in the \"sky\" picking up the bright yellow from the eggs. How was this done?<br/></td>', 'Very unusual perspective: were you dropping the eggs at your camera, or down to the hand? I like the use of light yellow in the \"sky\" picking up the bright yellow from the eggs. How was this done?', '2003-03-07 05:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(231055, 13340, 6230, '<td valign="top">More impact if shot taken at macro and ground level....to eliminate all those noise (grass).</td>', 'More impact if shot taken at macro and ground level....to eliminate all those noise (grass).', '2003-03-07 05:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(231057, 13270, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative: proud chicken!</td>', 'Very imaginative: proud chicken!', '2003-03-07 05:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(231058, 13356, 6892, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative idea. Keep up the good work. It is great to see young people starting out in photography because of their fresh new outlooks.</td>', 'Very imaginative idea. Keep up the good work. It is great to see young people starting out in photography because of their fresh new outlooks.', '2003-03-07 05:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(231060, 13334, 6892, '<td valign="top">How did you get the egg to seem suspended in space? It is good to see the occasional "other" type of egg rather than the standard white or brown, especially one with such a lovely color and textured surface.</td>', 'How did you get the egg to seem suspended in space? It is good to see the occasional "other" type of egg rather than the standard white or brown, especially one with such a lovely color and textured surface.', '2003-03-07 05:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(231095, 13308, 6576, '<td valign="top">It is nice to see Spring is coming somewhere, we just had more snow.</td>', 'It is nice to see Spring is coming somewhere, we just had more snow.', '2003-03-07 08:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(231100, 13331, 917, '<td valign="top">I prefer to see something of the context, is this in a field, a marsh, or what?</td>', 'I prefer to see something of the context, is this in a field, a marsh, or what?', '2003-03-07 08:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231101, 13215, 917, '<td valign="top">This would look great on a really large scale.</td>', 'This would look great on a really large scale.', '2003-03-07 08:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(231103, 13319, 917, '<td valign="top">I was going to try this, but didnt have any vinegar. I wondered if it was possible to peel the shell/membrane like a banana.</td>', 'I was going to try this, but didnt have any vinegar. I wondered if it was possible to peel the shell/membrane like a banana.', '2003-03-07 08:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(231106, 13498, 917, '<td valign="top">see my comments on the other lego shot.</td>', 'see my comments on the other lego shot.', '2003-03-07 09:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(231108, 13373, 917, '<td valign="top">eggcelent composition, one of the best this week.</td>', 'eggcelent composition, one of the best this week.', '2003-03-07 09:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(231109, 13382, 917, '<td valign="top">The narrowing of the cup at the bottom is a problem, try cutting some of the bottom off.</td>', 'The narrowing of the cup at the bottom is a problem, try cutting some of the bottom off.', '2003-03-07 09:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(231117, 13133, 1570, '<td valign="top">what a nice egg picture! but i see some jpeg artifacts on the front eggs...</td>', 'what a nice egg picture! but i see some jpeg artifacts on the front eggs...', '2003-03-07 09:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231118, 13413, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea!</td>', 'this is a great idea!', '2003-03-07 09:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231119, 13518, 772, '<td valign="top">nicely done :)  I really like the lighting here... it offers a surreal effect to the image... great work :) - setzler</td>', 'nicely done :)  I really like the lighting here... it offers a surreal effect to the image... great work :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 09:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(231122, 13275, 1570, '<td valign="top">the picture is nice, but could be brighter, especially with all these nice colors... the egg itself is a little out of focus, too...</td>', 'the picture is nice, but could be brighter, especially with all these nice colors... the egg itself is a little out of focus, too...', '2003-03-07 09:41:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(231124, 13382, 1570, '<td valign="top">great idea as well as the technical execution...good job!</td>', 'great idea as well as the technical execution...good job!', '2003-03-07 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(231125, 13216, 1570, '<td valign="top">nice and stately looking eggs! a different direction of lighting would''ve worked better without causing reflection of the pedestals...</td>', 'nice and stately looking eggs! a different direction of lighting would''ve worked better without causing reflection of the pedestals...', '2003-03-07 09:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(231127, 13376, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is very nice, one my favorites in this challenge! simple,yet original, pretty and very well done technically...</td>', 'this is very nice, one my favorites in this challenge! simple,yet original, pretty and very well done technically...', '2003-03-07 10:03:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(231135, 13447, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for this picture...I just find it to be a  bit underexposed</td>', 'I really like the idea for this picture...I just find it to be a  bit underexposed', '2003-03-07 10:18:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(231144, 13483, 5822, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for his photo but I find the contrast to be too low. I also feel indifferent about the duotone color and my own preference would have been for you to maintain the yellow color of the egg yoke against a purple background, which I believe would have conveyed "regal" more so. While you did well in preventing distracting reflections off of the glass, I find that the glass edges are not well defined enough so that the glass blends in too much to the background.</td>', 'I really like the idea for his photo but I find the contrast to be too low. I also feel indifferent about the duotone color and my own preference would have been for you to maintain the yellow color of the egg yoke against a purple background, which I believe would have conveyed "regal" more so. While you did well in preventing distracting reflections off of the glass, I find that the glass edges are not well defined enough so that the glass blends in too much to the background.', '2003-03-07 10:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(231147, 13523, 772, '<td valign="top">The tonal range in this photo is fairly flat and the focus doesn''t seem to be very sharp at any particular part of the image... - setzler</td>', 'The tonal range in this photo is fairly flat and the focus doesn''t seem to be very sharp at any particular part of the image... - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(231148, 13264, 772, '<td valign="top">good use of lighting in this shot... the ''tracks'' are a nice element also :) - setzler</td>', 'good use of lighting in this shot... the ''tracks'' are a nice element also :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231150, 13342, 772, '<td valign="top">This is definitely a unique capture :) - setzler</td>', 'This is definitely a unique capture :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(231151, 13294, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent color in this shot... i''m not sure if cutting off the base of the eggs was a great choice... - setzler</td>', 'excellent color in this shot... i''m not sure if cutting off the base of the eggs was a great choice... - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(231152, 13386, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting play on words :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting play on words :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:57:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(231153, 13252, 772, '<td valign="top">nice composition.. the diagonal works very well and the lighting is excellent :) - setzler</td>', 'nice composition.. the diagonal works very well and the lighting is excellent :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231154, 13363, 917, '<td valign="top">I love the tonal qualities on this.</td>', 'I love the tonal qualities on this.', '2003-03-07 10:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(231155, 13219, 772, '<td valign="top">veyr nice work... the shallow depth of field and the directional lighting make this a strong image :) - setzler</td>', 'veyr nice work... the shallow depth of field and the directional lighting make this a strong image :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(231156, 13492, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice abstract... I really like the centered composition of the eggs and the light reflections on the metallic surface... excellent work :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice abstract... I really like the centered composition of the eggs and the light reflections on the metallic surface... excellent work :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231157, 13242, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a nice ''abstract''.  I like the white on white theme, but i think it could be stronger with some directional lighting or something to make the shadows stand out a little more.. - setzler</td>', 'this is a nice ''abstract''.  I like the white on white theme, but i think it could be stronger with some directional lighting or something to make the shadows stand out a little more.. - setzler', '2003-03-07 10:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(231158, 13259, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting shot... the egg stands out nicely.  I believe that a different angle would produce some extra sense of depth and make a stronger image :) - setzler</td>', 'interesting shot... the egg stands out nicely.  I believe that a different angle would produce some extra sense of depth and make a stronger image :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(231159, 13172, 772, '<td valign="top">very interesting work... the shadow play on the eggs adds a nice element :) - setzler</td>', 'very interesting work... the shadow play on the eggs adds a nice element :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231160, 13250, 772, '<td valign="top">I can''t really determine a possible ''theme'' from this photo.  the relationship between the eggs and the environment doesn''t seem to create a lot of impact for me... - setzler</td>', 'I can''t really determine a possible ''theme'' from this photo.  the relationship between the eggs and the environment doesn''t seem to create a lot of impact for me... - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:02:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231166, 13184, 772, '<td valign="top">very nice composition... i think a slight rotation of the scene would create a stronger diagonal which would also work veyr nicely here :) - setzler</td>', 'very nice composition... i think a slight rotation of the scene would create a stronger diagonal which would also work veyr nicely here :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(231167, 13434, 772, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and a nice horizontal composition... good work :) - setzler</td>', 'excellent lighting and a nice horizontal composition... good work :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(231168, 13216, 772, '<td valign="top">the reflections in these eggs add a very interesting element.. nice work :) - setzler</td>', 'the reflections in these eggs add a very interesting element.. nice work :) - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(231169, 13390, 772, '<td valign="top">this is a very interesting composition and the lighting is also nice... there is some minor ''rainbow'' effect that I can''t really explain around this egg.  I''m not really sure what may be causing this, but a conversion to greyscale would probably make it less apparent.. - setzler</td>', 'this is a very interesting composition and the lighting is also nice... there is some minor ''rainbow'' effect that I can''t really explain around this egg.  I''m not really sure what may be causing this, but a conversion to greyscale would probably make it less apparent.. - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(231170, 13414, 772, '<td valign="top">good work with the reflections.. i believe that a slightly tighter crop on the top and bottom would make this stronger as well... - setzler</td>', 'good work with the reflections.. i believe that a slightly tighter crop on the top and bottom would make this stronger as well... - setzler', '2003-03-07 11:20:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231172, 13449, 7160, '<td valign="top">This picture is so cute!</td>', 'This picture is so cute!', '2003-03-07 11:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231176, 13460, 7160, '<td valign="top">A little dark, but a good picture.</td>', 'A little dark, but a good picture.', '2003-03-07 11:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(231177, 13430, 7160, '<td valign="top">Way too dark</td>', 'Way too dark', '2003-03-07 11:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(231178, 13395, 7160, '<td valign="top">Too dark</td>', 'Too dark', '2003-03-07 11:30:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(231179, 13523, 1826, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit over exposed. Good concept though.</td>', 'Looks a bit over exposed. Good concept though.', '2003-03-07 11:31:08.000000', NULL, 1),
