(231221, 13214, 1681, '<td valign="top">Very good.  I would have liked the needles to be greener (seem de-saturated).  I probably would have used three eggs for a slightly better composition.</td>', 'Very good.  I would have liked the needles to be greener (seem de-saturated).  I probably would have used three eggs for a slightly better composition.', '2003-03-07 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(231222, 13403, 1681, '<td valign="top">Like the concept! Great lighting and color.  Would have liked to see either more or less of the object that is holding the egg.</td>', 'Like the concept! Great lighting and color.  Would have liked to see either more or less of the object that is holding the egg.', '2003-03-07 12:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(231223, 13403, 7169, '<td valign="top">Best, most creative photo this week. Especially love the lighting effects.</td>', 'Best, most creative photo this week. Especially love the lighting effects.', '2003-03-07 13:02:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(231224, 13215, 1681, '<td valign="top">Like the high key style.  This one is maybe just a little too high key for my taste.  I think I would like to see (barely) the right edge of the egg or at least until it was out of frame.</td>', 'Like the high key style.  This one is maybe just a little too high key for my taste.  I think I would like to see (barely) the right edge of the egg or at least until it was out of frame.', '2003-03-07 13:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(231225, 13244, 1681, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The discoloration on the lower left side of the main egg draws my attention and think it would be better with a smoother, more evenly colored egg.  Image overall seems to lack some punch (maybe slightly underexposed?).  I do like the concept, composition, and dof.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The discoloration on the lower left side of the main egg draws my attention and think it would be better with a smoother, more evenly colored egg.  Image overall seems to lack some punch (maybe slightly underexposed?).  I do like the concept, composition, and dof.', '2003-03-07 13:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(231227, 13190, 1681, '<td valign="top">I think I would have rated this higher if the color balance was whiter (looks like it was shot under flourescent lighting.  Focus should have been just a little more forward in the shot (front edge of broken egg is not focused, but egg behind broken one is).  Still a great idea and shot.</td>', 'I think I would have rated this higher if the color balance was whiter (looks like it was shot under flourescent lighting.  Focus should have been just a little more forward in the shot (front edge of broken egg is not focused, but egg behind broken one is).  Still a great idea and shot.', '2003-03-07 13:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(231228, 13492, 1681, '<td valign="top">I really liked this image.  Good use of color.  I wish top left side of the second egg was a little more focused.</td>', 'I really liked this image.  Good use of color.  I wish top left side of the second egg was a little more focused.', '2003-03-07 13:13:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231229, 13459, 7169, '<td valign="top">I feel like this photo is a little too dark.</td>', 'I feel like this photo is a little too dark.', '2003-03-07 13:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(231230, 13249, 1681, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Great color.  I would really have to "nit-pik" to point out that the reflections from the light sources are a little too sharp and revealing.  Probably should have been diffused.</td>', 'Great idea.  Great color.  I would really have to "nit-pik" to point out that the reflections from the light sources are a little too sharp and revealing.  Probably should have been diffused.', '2003-03-07 13:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231239, 13272, 4049, '<td valign="top">the wrinkles in the backdrop are really distracting, use an iron.</td>', 'the wrinkles in the backdrop are really distracting, use an iron.', '2003-03-07 13:41:35.000000', NULL, 1),
