(231310, 13268, 1005, '<td valign="top">It is shockingly bright!  At first look, I thought the color intensity had affected the sharpness of this photo, but that''s more surprise/optical illusion.  The glare spots are a bit distracting, you might try softening your lighting.  Challenge wise - it''s a leap, but I''ll go with it.  5 Swash</td>', 'It is shockingly bright!  At first look, I thought the color intensity had affected the sharpness of this photo, but that''s more surprise/optical illusion.  The glare spots are a bit distracting, you might try softening your lighting.  Challenge wise - it''s a leap, but I''ll go with it.  5 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:06:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(231311, 13398, 1005, '<td valign="top">Focus and lighting seem really good.  Challenge well met.  While I see what you were going for with this angle, it just doesn''t seem effective in this case, but it''s better than the first score I gave it....score upgrade from 5 to 6.  Swash</td>', 'Focus and lighting seem really good.  Challenge well met.  While I see what you were going for with this angle, it just doesn''t seem effective in this case, but it''s better than the first score I gave it....score upgrade from 5 to 6.  Swash', '2003-03-07 15:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(231314, 13438, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very sharp focus on the egg basket (was that the point of this shot?).  Eggs are soft blurs.  5 Swash</td>', 'Very sharp focus on the egg basket (was that the point of this shot?).  Eggs are soft blurs.  5 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(231315, 13435, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea!  I''m sorry, but I cannot tell what is being focused on, all seems somewhat out of focus.  Overall image size is small and lacks detail.  The flames are a nice touch.  5 Swash</td>', 'Interesting idea!  I''m sorry, but I cannot tell what is being focused on, all seems somewhat out of focus.  Overall image size is small and lacks detail.  The flames are a nice touch.  5 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231318, 13505, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fun title!  Eggball in the corner pocket!  Focus seems sharp on the egg.  Lighting doesn''t really work for me, overall it seems dark, but the egg looks "right".  The eightball is a bit hard to see, the background is just distracting, but you have a bit of a glare spot on the cue (meaning more light wouldn''t be better).  Too bad the chalk was right were it is, adds another slight distraction.  6 Swash</td>', 'Fun title!  Eggball in the corner pocket!  Focus seems sharp on the egg.  Lighting doesn''t really work for me, overall it seems dark, but the egg looks "right".  The eightball is a bit hard to see, the background is just distracting, but you have a bit of a glare spot on the cue (meaning more light wouldn''t be better).  Too bad the chalk was right were it is, adds another slight distraction.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231319, 13193, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  IMO the background may have worked better if you outlined the tree shape (masked off the extra) and maybe ironed it flat.  I''m a bit of a consistency freak, so I think I would have preferred the red balls all oriented the say way.  Lighting - very inconsistent too, very light on right to very dark on left, plus the nearly unavoidable glare spots (unless you wanted them).  Challenge met.  Focus seems pretty good.  6 Swash</td>', 'Interesting idea.  IMO the background may have worked better if you outlined the tree shape (masked off the extra) and maybe ironed it flat.  I''m a bit of a consistency freak, so I think I would have preferred the red balls all oriented the say way.  Lighting - very inconsistent too, very light on right to very dark on left, plus the nearly unavoidable glare spots (unless you wanted them).  Challenge met.  Focus seems pretty good.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(231320, 13386, 4767, '<td valign="top">PUNIished?  This is not a yolk!</td>', 'PUNIished?  This is not a yolk!', '2003-03-07 15:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(231321, 13501, 4767, '<td valign="top">Wow!  A LOTTA work here!  Good planning, excellent follow-through.</td>', 'Wow!  A LOTTA work here!  Good planning, excellent follow-through.', '2003-03-07 15:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231322, 13428, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very strange!  Color and focus seem really good.  Lighting - overall it seems a bit dark, but the egg/shells/cigarette but all show up very well (the spatula less well).  Background is very wierd, looks more like a camping accident than anything else.  6 - Swash</td>', 'Very strange!  Color and focus seem really good.  Lighting - overall it seems a bit dark, but the egg/shells/cigarette but all show up very well (the spatula less well).  Background is very wierd, looks more like a camping accident than anything else.  6 - Swash', '2003-03-07 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(231323, 13225, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very strange shot.  Lighting seems harsh, but probably should be for this "effect".  Challenge - met.  Focus - kinda hard to say really due to the lighting.  I see from your title this is an UFO, but from the plexiglass up, I just don''t "get it".  <br/>6 Swash</td>', 'Very strange shot.  Lighting seems harsh, but probably should be for this "effect".  Challenge - met.  Focus - kinda hard to say really due to the lighting.  I see from your title this is an UFO, but from the plexiglass up, I just don''t "get it".  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231325, 13207, 1005, '<td valign="top">Yup, seven eggs...challenge met.  Focus and lighting seem good.  Cropping - your choice, no score effect.  Border - I usually don''t comment them, but this white border with white subjects doesn''t seem like a good idea, sort of like the eggs are bleeding off the pic type thing.  6 Swash</td>', 'Yup, seven eggs...challenge met.  Focus and lighting seem good.  Cropping - your choice, no score effect.  Border - I usually don''t comment them, but this white border with white subjects doesn''t seem like a good idea, sort of like the eggs are bleeding off the pic type thing.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(231326, 13392, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!  I like your subjects, but not your set up.  The lighting/background are too haphazard (too real life!).  A more controlled lighting and environment may have added considerable to this shot.  I like how the "eggs" reflect each other.  Small nit on the set up - left egg roll it so the label and hole do not show.  I don''t see any reason for the extra element.  6 Swash</td>', 'Neat idea!  I like your subjects, but not your set up.  The lighting/background are too haphazard (too real life!).  A more controlled lighting and environment may have added considerable to this shot.  I like how the "eggs" reflect each other.  Small nit on the set up - left egg roll it so the label and hole do not show.  I don''t see any reason for the extra element.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(231327, 13176, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting black on black shot, the idol shows up much better than I would have thought.  Good focus.  Cropping - I think I would have rather seen more of the egg, even at the cost of less of the statue (maybe 10 degrees up or so?)  6 Swash</td>', 'Interesting black on black shot, the idol shows up much better than I would have thought.  Good focus.  Cropping - I think I would have rather seen more of the egg, even at the cost of less of the statue (maybe 10 degrees up or so?)  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:39:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(231328, 13393, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fun title.  Focus seems pretty good.  Lighting is O.K..  Challenge met.  Sorry this is such a lame comment....I just can''t come up with anything clever to say.  Interest - moderate to low.  6 Swash</td>', 'Fun title.  Focus seems pretty good.  Lighting is O.K..  Challenge met.  Sorry this is such a lame comment....I just can''t come up with anything clever to say.  Interest - moderate to low.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(231330, 13286, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool trick shot.  The green coloration of the food is just too funny!  (DId it take alot of green food color?)  The yolks seem like the hardest trick and you "skipped" around that, well done, but (asking for moon and stars) wouldn''t it have been cooler if the yolks were intact with the eggs?  9 Swash</td>', 'Cool trick shot.  The green coloration of the food is just too funny!  (DId it take alot of green food color?)  The yolks seem like the hardest trick and you "skipped" around that, well done, but (asking for moon and stars) wouldn''t it have been cooler if the yolks were intact with the eggs?  9 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(231331, 13331, 1005, '<td valign="top">If true (title) totally amazing!  (If faked, convincingly done)  Color focus and lighting all seem pretty good.  Very nice job!  9 Swash</td>', 'If true (title) totally amazing!  (If faked, convincingly done)  Color focus and lighting all seem pretty good.  Very nice job!  9 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231332, 13445, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat shot!  Too bad you had to flash this (shadows and glare).  Color seems a little muted, but pretty good (esp. the wings of the parrot).  Challenge met.  6 Swash</td>', 'Neat shot!  Too bad you had to flash this (shadows and glare).  Color seems a little muted, but pretty good (esp. the wings of the parrot).  Challenge met.  6 Swash', '2003-03-07 15:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
