(231707, 13523, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this concept.  The image is suffering from lack of clarity.  Could also use a different background or more contrast perhaps.</td>', 'I like this concept.  The image is suffering from lack of clarity.  Could also use a different background or more contrast perhaps.', '2003-03-08 13:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(231712, 13269, 6870, '<td valign="top">Unusual and intriguing image. I like it. The egg seems slightly out of focus, and I would think you would want it in focus for this shot.</td>', 'Unusual and intriguing image. I like it. The egg seems slightly out of focus, and I would think you would want it in focus for this shot.', '2003-03-08 13:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(231713, 13205, 6870, '<td valign="top">An interesting and appropriate stylistic choice to have the eggs the same colors and tones at the illustrations behind them. Even harsher light and being more in focus would, I feel, increase the effectiveness and "illustrated" quality you were trying for here.</td>', 'An interesting and appropriate stylistic choice to have the eggs the same colors and tones at the illustrations behind them. Even harsher light and being more in focus would, I feel, increase the effectiveness and "illustrated" quality you were trying for here.', '2003-03-08 13:45:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(231714, 13173, 6870, '<td valign="top">I enjoy the originality of this  image. The lighting works well. Think about having a greater depth of field to bring more in focus.</td>', 'I enjoy the originality of this  image. The lighting works well. Think about having a greater depth of field to bring more in focus.', '2003-03-08 13:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231716, 13341, 1280, '<td valign="top">Interesting one!  Focus isn''t as sharp as it could be. Composition is very good.</td>', 'Interesting one!  Focus isn''t as sharp as it could be. Composition is very good.', '2003-03-08 13:47:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(231717, 13461, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea here. I like the cleverness of the image. Note how the eggs in front are in focus, though, when it should probably be the white, real egg. A dark background might enhance the colors of the eggs more than a white background.</td>', 'Fun idea here. I like the cleverness of the image. Note how the eggs in front are in focus, though, when it should probably be the white, real egg. A dark background might enhance the colors of the eggs more than a white background.', '2003-03-08 13:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(231719, 13393, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well composed placement of objects, and the lighting is good. It seems that the egg in back should be the one in focus, however, instead of the balls in the middle.</td>', 'Well composed placement of objects, and the lighting is good. It seems that the egg in back should be the one in focus, however, instead of the balls in the middle.', '2003-03-08 13:48:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(231720, 13128, 6870, '<td valign="top">Wonderful idea, and the contrast between the brown and white works well. The lighting is appropriate, too. The white egg seems out of focus, when I think that''s the one you really want in focus.</td>', 'Wonderful idea, and the contrast between the brown and white works well. The lighting is appropriate, too. The white egg seems out of focus, when I think that''s the one you really want in focus.', '2003-03-08 13:50:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(231722, 13258, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun image, with a lot of whimsical mood to it''s basic idea. It is a little dark for me for no apparent reason: in other words, I can''t see that the darkness enhances the image in any strong way. Try using manual focus to make sure the eggs are in focus.</td>', 'Fun image, with a lot of whimsical mood to it''s basic idea. It is a little dark for me for no apparent reason: in other words, I can''t see that the darkness enhances the image in any strong way. Try using manual focus to make sure the eggs are in focus.', '2003-03-08 13:52:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(231723, 13382, 6870, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus, and a clever political message to boot. Try experimenting with different backgrounds to really enhance the objects.</td>', 'Sharp focus, and a clever political message to boot. Try experimenting with different backgrounds to really enhance the objects.', '2003-03-08 13:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(231724, 13439, 6870, '<td valign="top">Nice tones and moods here! The egg is out of focus, perhaps in deference to the glass.</td>', 'Nice tones and moods here! The egg is out of focus, perhaps in deference to the glass.', '2003-03-08 13:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231725, 13359, 6870, '<td valign="top">Delightfully cynical title and appropriate image. MIght be more effective if the yold and egg were more in focus and the lighting more "sinister."</td>', 'Delightfully cynical title and appropriate image. MIght be more effective if the yold and egg were more in focus and the lighting more "sinister."', '2003-03-08 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(231726, 13515, 6870, '<td valign="top">Good placement of egg in frame. I like the idea, too. Try a greater depth of field to capture the entire egg in focus. A darker background might enhance the image, too.</td>', 'Good placement of egg in frame. I like the idea, too. Try a greater depth of field to capture the entire egg in focus. A darker background might enhance the image, too.', '2003-03-08 13:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(231727, 13222, 6870, '<td valign="top">A cool idea. THe eggs are out of focus, however, and this is really distracting. I love the computer stamped lettering on the eggs--it gives a great mood to the whole photo. Good placement of eggs in the frame.</td>', 'A cool idea. THe eggs are out of focus, however, and this is really distracting. I love the computer stamped lettering on the eggs--it gives a great mood to the whole photo. Good placement of eggs in the frame.', '2003-03-08 13:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(231728, 13476, 6870, '<td valign="top">Quirky, fun idea. I''m glad your model has freckles, which contrast well against the white of the egg. In fact, a model with dark skin may even work better. Try experimenting with angles and levels of light to create more drama to the image, and make sure the egg is in focus.</td>', 'Quirky, fun idea. I''m glad your model has freckles, which contrast well against the white of the egg. In fact, a model with dark skin may even work better. Try experimenting with angles and levels of light to create more drama to the image, and make sure the egg is in focus.', '2003-03-08 13:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(231729, 13272, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun idea that works for me. Lighting is great. Quite out of focus, however, though I can see an argument for a "soft focus." This doesn''t appear to have "soft focus" however, it just looks blurry.</td>', 'Fun idea that works for me. Lighting is great. Quite out of focus, however, though I can see an argument for a "soft focus." This doesn''t appear to have "soft focus" however, it just looks blurry.', '2003-03-08 14:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231730, 13504, 6870, '<td valign="top">INteresting way the light bounces around in this image, that I really like. I wish the egg were in focus, though.</td>', 'INteresting way the light bounces around in this image, that I really like. I wish the egg were in focus, though.', '2003-03-08 14:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231731, 13402, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting still life. Try different light sources, angles and levels to provide even more drama.</td>', 'Interesting still life. Try different light sources, angles and levels to provide even more drama.', '2003-03-08 14:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231732, 13399, 6870, '<td valign="top">The patterns of the carton enhance the feeling of loneliness here. I just wish the eggs were more in focus as the title suggests they should be.</td>', 'The patterns of the carton enhance the feeling of loneliness here. I just wish the eggs were more in focus as the title suggests they should be.', '2003-03-08 14:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(231733, 13508, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m slightly colorblind, so I can''t see the green here, but I''ll trust you. I do like the placement of the yolk in the frame. Try a greater depth of field to get more in focus.</td>', 'I''m slightly colorblind, so I can''t see the green here, but I''ll trust you. I do like the placement of the yolk in the frame. Try a greater depth of field to get more in focus.', '2003-03-08 14:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
