(231751, 13190, 7033, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot-- I especially like the texture of the shell and the eggholder contrasted with the smoothness of the eggwhite.  Lighting is excellent, too!</td>', 'Beautiful shot-- I especially like the texture of the shell and the eggholder contrasted with the smoothness of the eggwhite.  Lighting is excellent, too!', '2003-03-08 16:28:42.000000', NULL, 1),
