(231760, 13207, 7033, '<td valign="top">I don''t know exactly what it is, but I love this shot!  Maybe the sharp contrast between the eggs and the background, or the subtle shadows.  Nice!</td>', 'I don''t know exactly what it is, but I love this shot!  Maybe the sharp contrast between the eggs and the background, or the subtle shadows.  Nice!', '2003-03-08 16:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
