(231829, 13403, 1280, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  This is prolly the prettiest of all the egg pictures.  I really like it! The exposure is perfect, the coloring is lovely, the opening is just the right size, and I love the lighting.  Definetly one of my favorites this week.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice!  This is prolly the prettiest of all the egg pictures.  I really like it! The exposure is perfect, the coloring is lovely, the opening is just the right size, and I love the lighting.  Definetly one of my favorites this week.  Good luck!', '2003-03-08 21:18:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(231831, 13280, 3447, '<td valign="top">Clever idea...good sharp photo...and you really know borders.</td>', 'Clever idea...good sharp photo...and you really know borders.', '2003-03-08 21:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(231834, 13250, 6870, '<td valign="top">I love the tones and textures here! I wish everything were in focus.</td>', 'I love the tones and textures here! I wish everything were in focus.', '2003-03-08 21:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
