(231900, 13222, 6479, '<td valign="top">Good job. Nice pic.</td>', 'Good job. Nice pic.', '2003-03-08 22:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231902, 13414, 6479, '<td valign="top">Good job. Nice pic.</td>', 'Good job. Nice pic.', '2003-03-08 22:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(231903, 13414, 4210, '<td valign="top">Personally, with this shot I would have used just the glass egg, elevated it off the surface a little (somehow), taken a photo, cropped just to show the refection, and flipped it to make the reflection right side up. It might not have fit the challenge as well, but it would be cool! I think that reflection looks great.</td>', 'Personally, with this shot I would have used just the glass egg, elevated it off the surface a little (somehow), taken a photo, cropped just to show the refection, and flipped it to make the reflection right side up. It might not have fit the challenge as well, but it would be cool! I think that reflection looks great.', '2003-03-08 22:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(231904, 13203, 4210, '<td valign="top">Great effect!! Made me think for a moment there.</td>', 'Great effect!! Made me think for a moment there.', '2003-03-08 22:37:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(231909, 13521, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting here, the coloring really adds to the photo</td>', 'I like the lighting here, the coloring really adds to the photo', '2003-03-08 23:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(231910, 13322, 6477, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2003-03-08 23:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(231911, 13493, 509, '<td valign="top">Love to hear how you achieved the spherical lighting on the side, nice work</td>', 'Love to hear how you achieved the spherical lighting on the side, nice work', '2003-03-08 23:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(231914, 13361, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice depth of field here.  To me the flower on the top seems a little overexposed, but it probably seems that way just because it is brighter than the other flowers.  Other than that, a very nice flower shot - 7 - Mav</td>', 'Very nice depth of field here.  To me the flower on the top seems a little overexposed, but it probably seems that way just because it is brighter than the other flowers.  Other than that, a very nice flower shot - 7 - Mav', '2003-03-08 23:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(231915, 13505, 509, '<td valign="top">To me this seems a little constrained, I would like to see more of the table.  Also, I think this could have benifitted from a little more lighting, and possibly a higher angle so the picture in the background doesn''t get in the way.  Nice idea</td>', 'To me this seems a little constrained, I would like to see more of the table.  Also, I think this could have benifitted from a little more lighting, and possibly a higher angle so the picture in the background doesn''t get in the way.  Nice idea', '2003-03-08 23:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(231916, 13376, 509, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I really like the lighting here - 10 - Mav</td>', 'Great shot!  I really like the lighting here - 10 - Mav', '2003-03-08 23:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(231917, 13186, 6803, '<td valign="top">I think you croped too much, I like the b/w</td>', 'I think you croped too much, I like the b/w', '2003-03-08 23:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(231918, 13499, 509, '<td valign="top">Not bad, but there are a couple things I think could be improved: the focus is pretty soft here, it''s hard to make out if that''s an eye on the egg or something else.  This is just a personal preference, but I think if all the blocks were a uniform color or pattern it would be more appealing.  Also, I''d like to see a little more of the egg.  For this color combination, however, the frame works nicely</td>', 'Not bad, but there are a couple things I think could be improved: the focus is pretty soft here, it''s hard to make out if that''s an eye on the egg or something else.  This is just a personal preference, but I think if all the blocks were a uniform color or pattern it would be more appealing.  Also, I''d like to see a little more of the egg.  For this color combination, however, the frame works nicely', '2003-03-08 23:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231919, 13409, 509, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if that''s an egg, but I like it regardless, nice flame</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if that''s an egg, but I like it regardless, nice flame', '2003-03-08 23:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231923, 13498, 509, '<td valign="top">after voting on all the images, I noticed that this is the exact same subject as "humpty dumpty sat in a cell" right down to the colored blocks = P<br/>I would have preferred a smaller aperture to get the bars in focus as well as the egg.  Also, the color balance seems rather warm.</td>', 'after voting on all the images, I noticed that this is the exact same subject as "humpty dumpty sat in a cell" right down to the colored blocks = PI would have preferred a smaller aperture to get the bars in focus as well as the egg.  Also, the color balance seems rather warm.', '2003-03-08 23:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(231927, 13339, 5753, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  Perhaps if the bottom of the sink(?) was black, the contrast in the bubbles would show up even more.  8</td>', 'Excellent idea.  Perhaps if the bottom of the sink(?) was black, the contrast in the bubbles would show up even more.  8', '2003-03-09 00:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(231928, 13480, 5753, '<td valign="top">Sweet stuff, excellent light work to turn an egg into a sunset.  IMO, it would be even more striking if the bottom was cutoff to represent the horizon, but I guess you wanted to still show shape of the egg.  8</td>', 'Sweet stuff, excellent light work to turn an egg into a sunset.  IMO, it would be even more striking if the bottom was cutoff to represent the horizon, but I guess you wanted to still show shape of the egg.  8', '2003-03-09 00:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(231929, 13363, 5753, '<td valign="top">I bet you got a lot of comments saying that your shot was too dark eh?  I think its great, it enhances the contrasts.  Great choice of fabric, goes well with the eggs.</td>', 'I bet you got a lot of comments saying that your shot was too dark eh?  I think its great, it enhances the contrasts.  Great choice of fabric, goes well with the eggs.', '2003-03-09 01:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231930, 13194, 5753, '<td valign="top">Great colour, reflection and lighting.  Would be even better if the shot was a little bit more centred. 7</td>', 'Great colour, reflection and lighting.  Would be even better if the shot was a little bit more centred. 7', '2003-03-09 01:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(231933, 13135, 3018, '<td valign="top">Aliens!!!</td>', 'Aliens!!!', '2003-03-09 01:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(231934, 13494, 5753, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrasts.  The "meat" of the shot seems a little off to the left of the picture, perhaps a little nudge to the right would improve this shot. Good work. 8</td>', 'Very nice contrasts.  The "meat" of the shot seems a little off to the left of the picture, perhaps a little nudge to the right would improve this shot. Good work. 8', '2003-03-09 01:15:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(231935, 13306, 5753, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Very crafty.  It would be better if the eggs didn''t give the impression that the shot is off centered to the right.  8</td>', 'Wow!  Very crafty.  It would be better if the eggs didn''t give the impression that the shot is off centered to the right.  8', '2003-03-09 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231936, 13446, 5753, '<td valign="top">You must have a very healthy diet! 9</td>', 'You must have a very healthy diet! 9', '2003-03-09 01:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(231941, 13306, 3607, '<td valign="top">this is clearly a high quality photo done by someone who knows something about using a camera.  technically there isn''t much to complain about here, but ultimately do i find this a compelling, original photo?  no (although i''d love to know how this was done), maybe because the portrait is greater than the eggs.  yes, you use eggs, but they aren''t relevant to your photo (the eggs without the boy would make no sense, the boy with out the eggs would do just fine).</td>', 'this is clearly a high quality photo done by someone who knows something about using a camera.  technically there isn''t much to complain about here, but ultimately do i find this a compelling, original photo?  no (although i''d love to know how this was done), maybe because the portrait is greater than the eggs.  yes, you use eggs, but they aren''t relevant to your photo (the eggs without the boy would make no sense, the boy with out the eggs would do just fine).', '2003-03-09 02:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231963, 13322, 6752, '<td valign="top">nice and simple, great shot</td>', 'nice and simple, great shot', '2003-03-09 06:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(231964, 13381, 6752, '<td valign="top">good photo, but i would have like less "sky" in the photo</td>', 'good photo, but i would have like less "sky" in the photo', '2003-03-09 06:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(231965, 13379, 6752, '<td valign="top">great color,</td>', 'great color,', '2003-03-09 06:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(231966, 13446, 6752, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2003-03-09 06:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(231967, 13224, 6999, '<td valign="top">A really good effort - but I wanted to see some motion on the egg, just the vague kind of blur a slower shutter would have given. And also, the whites have blatted out, and the horizon not being horizontal bothers me - in fact, all the background bothers me. A pity, as that would have made it my favourite of the week by far. Think you gave yourself a massive challenge, and it nearly worked! Good stuff</td>', 'A really good effort - but I wanted to see some motion on the egg, just the vague kind of blur a slower shutter would have given. And also, the whites have blatted out, and the horizon not being horizontal bothers me - in fact, all the background bothers me. A pity, as that would have made it my favourite of the week by far. Think you gave yourself a massive challenge, and it nearly worked! Good stuff', '2003-03-09 06:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(231968, 13494, 6999, '<td valign="top">For me, too contrast-y and too ordinary an angle of shot (I''m just explaining what lost you marks). Would like to see a low level shot of this.</td>', 'For me, too contrast-y and too ordinary an angle of shot (I''m just explaining what lost you marks). Would like to see a low level shot of this.', '2003-03-09 06:14:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(231969, 13403, 6999, '<td valign="top">7. I''m not sure about DOF - did you try a version with the holder in focus? My eye is drawn to the inside of the egg, and it''s the shell that is in focus. And what most let it down for me is that it needs rotating - and there seems no good reason for it being tilted slightly. Nice try though</td>', '7. I''m not sure about DOF - did you try a version with the holder in focus? My eye is drawn to the inside of the egg, and it''s the shell that is in focus. And what most let it down for me is that it needs rotating - and there seems no good reason for it being tilted slightly. Nice try though', '2003-03-09 06:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(231970, 13412, 6752, '<td valign="top">one of the only photos of an egg that is not a hens egg, but the photo is still lacking , well thats my 2cent</td>', 'one of the only photos of an egg that is not a hens egg, but the photo is still lacking , well thats my 2cent', '2003-03-09 06:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(231971, 13523, 6144, '<td valign="top">clever theme and imagination....</td>', 'clever theme and imagination....', '2003-03-09 06:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(231972, 13274, 6144, '<td valign="top">nice study in texture and color and contrast</td>', 'nice study in texture and color and contrast', '2003-03-09 06:20:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(231974, 13286, 6144, '<td valign="top">cute, clever and colorful</td>', 'cute, clever and colorful', '2003-03-09 06:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(231975, 13480, 6144, '<td valign="top">good work to turn the plain into something interesting....nice colors</td>', 'good work to turn the plain into something interesting....nice colors', '2003-03-09 06:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(231976, 13460, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very nice indeed. The detail of the broken shell is great, the bar of shadow rreally helps the comp. For me, the footprints are too much, and I think it''s a realy pity that all of the shell isn''t in shot. Shaded areas are quite noisy too - though it''s difficult to mark people down for that given the file sizes needed here. Good work</td>', 'Very nice indeed. The detail of the broken shell is great, the bar of shadow rreally helps the comp. For me, the footprints are too much, and I think it''s a realy pity that all of the shell isn''t in shot. Shaded areas are quite noisy too - though it''s difficult to mark people down for that given the file sizes needed here. Good work', '2003-03-09 06:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(231977, 13485, 6144, '<td valign="top">neat picture.....great mixture of color, shadow and contrast</td>', 'neat picture.....great mixture of color, shadow and contrast', '2003-03-09 06:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(231978, 13460, 6144, '<td valign="top">nice work with shawdow and texture</td>', 'nice work with shawdow and texture', '2003-03-09 06:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(231980, 13355, 6999, '<td valign="top">V small pic! Like the blue wall very much - what a gift to photo! did you try having the foreground eggs in focus and the background out? I think the composition draws the eye to the edge of the basket, rather than the wall, and so the DOF confuses things here. Also (small point) the eggs don''t look fragile enough to me: too shiny, could almost be porcelain fake ones. Nice try though. 6</td>', 'V small pic! Like the blue wall very much - what a gift to photo! did you try having the foreground eggs in focus and the background out? I think the composition draws the eye to the edge of the basket, rather than the wall, and so the DOF confuses things here. Also (small point) the eggs don''t look fragile enough to me: too shiny, could almost be porcelain fake ones. Nice try though. 6', '2003-03-09 06:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(231981, 13382, 6144, '<td valign="top">nice work with texture and composition</td>', 'nice work with texture and composition', '2003-03-09 06:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(231982, 13183, 6144, '<td valign="top">good b &amp; w composition. nice touch with the layout</td>', 'good b & w composition. nice touch with the layout', '2003-03-09 06:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(231983, 13481, 6144, '<td valign="top">nice layout...good work with colors, contrast and textures</td>', 'nice layout...good work with colors, contrast and textures', '2003-03-09 06:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(231984, 13207, 6999, '<td valign="top">Always intersting to see an effectively black and white composition in full colour, especially digital - shows how critical white balance can be. Like the framing, and the grouping, but the highlights are a little over-exposed for me - could have been a half stop less. 7</td>', 'Always intersting to see an effectively black and white composition in full colour, especially digital - shows how critical white balance can be. Like the framing, and the grouping, but the highlights are a little over-exposed for me - could have been a half stop less. 7', '2003-03-09 06:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
