(231992, 13203, 6999, '<td valign="top">Very interesting - but no real impression of motion (either that or these eggs are huge!). Really well executed though. The diagonal of the arm is very strong too. I found it perplexing rather than striking, if you know what I mean.</td>', 'Very interesting - but no real impression of motion (either that or these eggs are huge!). Really well executed though. The diagonal of the arm is very strong too. I found it perplexing rather than striking, if you know what I mean.', '2003-03-09 06:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
