(231994, 13273, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s something here I can''t quite put my finger on that I don''t like: great idea, and well executed; clever, the composition is excellent, especially the wide framing of the shot. Maybe I''m just not a fan of such contrived shots? Still giving you an 8 though.<br/> <br/>On reviewing things: I now think the sun/light is too central to the composition (this is what was bugging me). And there''s a lack of detail on the surface? It seems not quite in focus ... 7 now :-(</td>', 'There''s something here I can''t quite put my finger on that I don''t like: great idea, and well executed; clever, the composition is excellent, especially the wide framing of the shot. Maybe I''m just not a fan of such contrived shots? Still giving you an 8 though. On reviewing things: I now think the sun/light is too central to the composition (this is what was bugging me). And there''s a lack of detail on the surface? It seems not quite in focus ... 7 now :-(', '2003-03-09 06:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
