(232084, 13315, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great idea with the shells. Wonderful composition. This is a beautiful image.<br/> <br/>I''d have been tempted to crack the egg, remove the yoke, include only the shell fragments and place them in the upper third quadrant. This would have dovetailed with the "shell" concept really well.<br/> <br/>This is one of the best images of the week.</td>', 'Great idea with the shells. Wonderful composition. This is a beautiful image. I''d have been tempted to crack the egg, remove the yoke, include only the shell fragments and place them in the upper third quadrant. This would have dovetailed with the "shell" concept really well. This is one of the best images of the week.', '2003-03-09 15:02:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(232086, 13181, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well composed, great focus and a background that emphasizes the clarity of the image. Technically a great shot.<br/> <br/>Simple is better and this is clearly one of the best in a week chucked full of many, many great images.</td>', 'Well composed, great focus and a background that emphasizes the clarity of the image. Technically a great shot. Simple is better and this is clearly one of the best in a week chucked full of many, many great images.', '2003-03-09 15:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(232087, 13264, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and composition.  Technically excellant. Great work.</td>', 'Great lighting and composition.  Technically excellant. Great work.', '2003-03-09 15:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(232088, 13300, 5792, '<td valign="top">Choice of color and composition in this image is excellant. The soft shadow is terrific. <br/> <br/>It is difficult to create a color image with the same balance of light and shadow that monochrome images have when they are rated high. But this images does it beautifully. I really like the combination of browns that set this image a cut above the others.</td>', 'Choice of color and composition in this image is excellant. The soft shadow is terrific.  It is difficult to create a color image with the same balance of light and shadow that monochrome images have when they are rated high. But this images does it beautifully. I really like the combination of browns that set this image a cut above the others.', '2003-03-09 15:14:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(232090, 13340, 5792, '<td valign="top">This image is technically superior. For me, what makes this image great is the ominous presence of the golf club and what that means to the poor egg.<br/> <br/>Great idea and a beautiful image.</td>', 'This image is technically superior. For me, what makes this image great is the ominous presence of the golf club and what that means to the poor egg. Great idea and a beautiful image.', '2003-03-09 15:23:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(232091, 13246, 5792, '<td valign="top">Superb color in a very well composed image. The white background beautifully emphasizes the brown.</td>', 'Superb color in a very well composed image. The white background beautifully emphasizes the brown.', '2003-03-09 15:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
