(232281, 13412, 1280, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  I''d actually considered caviar too, but I don''t like it, so I didn''t wanna waste the moolah!  lol<br/>Nice color contrasts here, and good lines.  Good luck!</td>', 'Good idea.  I''d actually considered caviar too, but I don''t like it, so I didn''t wanna waste the moolah!  lolNice color contrasts here, and good lines.  Good luck!', '2003-03-09 22:29:37.000000', NULL, 1),
