(232357, 13493, 2003, '<td valign="top">my intent was to have just the eggs in the shot , spot-lit from front-right for the "crescent moon" effect --- lens flare was accident, and i reshot the pic with the light blocked out --- but when i looked at the final results, i liked the flare more than the rest</td>', 'my intent was to have just the eggs in the shot , spot-lit from front-right for the "crescent moon" effect --- lens flare was accident, and i reshot the pic with the light blocked out --- but when i looked at the final results, i liked the flare more than the rest', '2003-03-10 00:17:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(232361, 13446, 5120, '<td valign="top">What a rip-off.  I guess there are too many uptite people in here, I fully expected this pic to get 1st place.  GREAT PIC!  I was laughing about this one all week long.  It is the one pic that really stood out for me.<br/> <br/>Greg</td>', 'What a rip-off.  I guess there are too many uptite people in here, I fully expected this pic to get 1st place.  GREAT PIC!  I was laughing about this one all week long.  It is the one pic that really stood out for me. Greg', '2003-03-10 00:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
