(232568, 13447, 6328, '<td valign="top">Greetings :)from Silver Fox<br/>My first impression was how grotesque, however, it''s a very interesting idea that you''ve come up with.<br/>It does seem a bit out of focus and the lighting is kind of poor, giving it an overall blue tinge, making it difficult to decide where to focus my eyes.<br/>I''m really glas you didn''t have any of the egg leaking out. . .<br/> <br/>Your work was creative and certainly unique, so keep at it. .</td>', 'Greetings :)from Silver FoxMy first impression was how grotesque, however, it''s a very interesting idea that you''ve come up with.It does seem a bit out of focus and the lighting is kind of poor, giving it an overall blue tinge, making it difficult to decide where to focus my eyes.I''m really glas you didn''t have any of the egg leaking out. . . Your work was creative and certainly unique, so keep at it. .', '2003-03-10 02:02:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(232575, 13426, 6172, '<td valign="top">Seems like a good concept to me.  Your focus was pretty good, though as some said, it seemed weak on the egg.  The lighting was the strong point of this photo, and to eliminate all reflections was commendable.  Good coloring.  The crop might have been different to improve the photo, especially on the bottom.</td>', 'Seems like a good concept to me.  Your focus was pretty good, though as some said, it seemed weak on the egg.  The lighting was the strong point of this photo, and to eliminate all reflections was commendable.  Good coloring.  The crop might have been different to improve the photo, especially on the bottom.', '2003-03-10 02:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(232581, 13249, 92, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your well deserved win !</td>', 'Congrats on your well deserved win !', '2003-03-10 02:12:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(232584, 13476, 6370, '<td valign="top">nicely done.  too bad you got hammered by the voters.</td>', 'nicely done.  too bad you got hammered by the voters.', '2003-03-10 02:15:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(232629, 13266, 6049, '<td valign="top">thanks for your votes :-)<br/> <br/>this was done using a mirror to reflect the sky as my backdrop and place the egg on the mirror. play with curves and saturation to get this effect.</td>', 'thanks for your votes :-) this was done using a mirror to reflect the sky as my backdrop and place the egg on the mirror. play with curves and saturation to get this effect.', '2003-03-10 05:05:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(232638, 13446, 6097, '<td valign="top">I agree.  This shot was super funny and was also the one that stood out for me this week.  I thought for sure It would have gotten 1st or at least 3rd.  You must be right, too many uptight people.  I at least thought this the one of the most artistic shots of the week.  I personally thought it was better than mine but I placed higher than this.  Go figure.  Once again.  Someone has paid the price for being original.  22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.  Oh well.  By the comments it looks like plenty of people did like it.  Congratulations anyway!</td>', 'I agree.  This shot was super funny and was also the one that stood out for me this week.  I thought for sure It would have gotten 1st or at least 3rd.  You must be right, too many uptight people.  I at least thought this the one of the most artistic shots of the week.  I personally thought it was better than mine but I placed higher than this.  Go figure.  Once again.  Someone has paid the price for being original.  22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.  Oh well.  By the comments it looks like plenty of people did like it.  Congratulations anyway!', '2003-03-10 06:55:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(232656, 13249, 5982, '<td valign="top">Congrats!  Very Nice shots!  My favorite!</td>', 'Congrats!  Very Nice shots!  My favorite!', '2003-03-10 07:48:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(232671, 13382, 3942, '<td valign="top">Thanks again to all of you!<br/> <br/>I had some trouble with the sharpness of the staples in this shot. The original photo has a good focus and I didnt sharpen that much after resizing. But already by using  the lowest level of the sharpen filter in PhotoImpact, the staples are looking a little oversharpened (but the egg itself doesnt).  Does somebody know the reason? Perhaps I had the problem because of the gleamy material of the staples?<br/> <br/>As I can see in the comments, some of you dont understand the title. Maybe I didnt found the correct english word. On Sunday morning I didnt wanted to eat my egg and the idea of reclosing an opened egg was born. This decision was a kind of reprieve or amnesty for the egg ;-) <br/>Btw: An amnestied prisoner never will be the same person after the end of his captivity. The time without freedom will leave its mark. But perhaps this is too much interpretation of an simple egg shot :-)<br/></td>', 'Thanks again to all of you! I had some trouble with the sharpness of the staples in this shot. The original photo has a good focus and I didnt sharpen that much after resizing. But already by using  the lowest level of the sharpen filter in PhotoImpact, the staples are looking a little oversharpened (but the egg itself doesnt).  Does somebody know the reason? Perhaps I had the problem because of the gleamy material of the staples? As I can see in the comments, some of you dont understand the title. Maybe I didnt found the correct english word. On Sunday morning I didnt wanted to eat my egg and the idea of reclosing an opened egg was born. This decision was a kind of reprieve or amnesty for the egg ;-) Btw: An amnestied prisoner never will be the same person after the end of his captivity. The time without freedom will leave its mark. But perhaps this is too much interpretation of an simple egg shot :-)', '2003-03-10 07:59:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(232686, 13215, 2677, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for the comments!  undieyatch, I''m curious to know what showed up on your monitor.  Please email me if you get a chance.</td>', 'Thanks everyone for the comments!  undieyatch, I''m curious to know what showed up on your monitor.  Please email me if you get a chance.', '2003-03-10 08:02:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(232720, 13403, 3981, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all of you for your votes and for your comments, which truly do help.  I''m here to learn, so I take all constuctive criticism positively. This is my first ribbon on DP Challenge, and I was shocked and excited to find my Cosmic Egg had placed 2nd with a Red ribbon! I''m a previous SLR user and have just gone to digital a few months ago.<br/>Thanks again!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-10 08:18:08.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all of you for your votes and for your comments, which truly do help.  I''m here to learn, so I take all constuctive criticism positively. This is my first ribbon on DP Challenge, and I was shocked and excited to find my Cosmic Egg had placed 2nd with a Red ribbon! I''m a previous SLR user and have just gone to digital a few months ago.Thanks again!!', '2003-03-10 08:16:59.000000', '2003-03-10 08:18:08.000000', 0),
(232724, 13421, 3599, '<td valign="top">So many great egg shots, oh well.  I did think this one would do better.</td>', 'So many great egg shots, oh well.  I did think this one would do better.', '2003-03-10 08:22:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(232731, 13249, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great colors and perfect cropping! Congrats!</td>', 'Great colors and perfect cropping! Congrats!', '2003-03-10 08:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(232738, 13249, 4729, '<td valign="top">Thank you very much! I am flattered and honored to have won this ribbon. I appreciate all the comments and votes received...thank you so much! (Sorry if this photo has offended some!)</td>', 'Thank you very much! I am flattered and honored to have won this ribbon. I appreciate all the comments and votes received...thank you so much! (Sorry if this photo has offended some!)', '2003-03-10 08:38:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(232749, 13382, 5728, '<td valign="top">Gratuliere Matthes!</td>', 'Gratuliere Matthes!', '2003-03-10 08:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(232755, 13249, 656, '<td valign="top">Great colours - congratulations on winning.</td>', 'Great colours - congratulations on winning.', '2003-03-10 09:03:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(232759, 13438, 2634, '<td valign="top">Not that I thought that this was a great photo by any means, but I am very disappointed to see such low scores(six 1''s!). This photo was done with a  short DOF intentionally! I wanted to focus on the basket. Yet every comment indicates that the focus was supposed to be on the eggs. Why? There is such a thing as artistic quality to a photo, I think some of the viewers need to learn about that.</td>', 'Not that I thought that this was a great photo by any means, but I am very disappointed to see such low scores(six 1''s!). This photo was done with a  short DOF intentionally! I wanted to focus on the basket. Yet every comment indicates that the focus was supposed to be on the eggs. Why? There is such a thing as artistic quality to a photo, I think some of the viewers need to learn about that.', '2003-03-10 09:08:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(232779, 13281, 5728, '<td valign="top">I thought this one would do a lot better. Just goes to show you how people''s tastes differ!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-10 09:17:13.</i></td>', 'I thought this one would do a lot better. Just goes to show you how people''s tastes differ!', '2003-03-10 09:16:44.000000', '2003-03-10 09:17:13.000000', 0),
(232809, 13511, 6025, '<td valign="top">(CC)<br/> <br/>An incredible image indeed. I love the lighting and the relative fuzziness of the shadow in teh background. The picture seems slightly blurred (out of focus?), but the high amount of motherly love is definitely great. As for why it did not rank better than it did: God knows. I definitely like this shot. <br/> <br/>The background is a bit noisy, though. Perhaps you should have thrown it better out of focus? Or even aimed a flash at it, to blow it out completely? <br/> <br/>Anywho. Great job, and there are not a lot of things you could have done to improve this. Keep it up, and good luck in the next challenge!</td>', '(CC) An incredible image indeed. I love the lighting and the relative fuzziness of the shadow in teh background. The picture seems slightly blurred (out of focus?), but the high amount of motherly love is definitely great. As for why it did not rank better than it did: God knows. I definitely like this shot.  The background is a bit noisy, though. Perhaps you should have thrown it better out of focus? Or even aimed a flash at it, to blow it out completely?  Anywho. Great job, and there are not a lot of things you could have done to improve this. Keep it up, and good luck in the next challenge!', '2003-03-10 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(232812, 13286, 5728, '<td valign="top">I guess not too many people linked this to Dr. Seuss. What a pity, it should have done much better.</td>', 'I guess not too many people linked this to Dr. Seuss. What a pity, it should have done much better.', '2003-03-10 09:31:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(232912, 13249, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very nice! I''m not sure if I commented before, but congratulations!</td>', 'Very nice! I''m not sure if I commented before, but congratulations!', '2003-03-10 10:18:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(232968, 13446, 4520, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by wackybill:</b></div><hr/><i>I agree.  This shot was super funny and was also the one that stood out for me this week.  I thought for sure It would have gotten 1st or at least 3rd.  You must be right, too many uptight people.  I at least thought this the one of the most artistic shots of the week.  I personally thought it was better than mine but I placed higher than this.  Go figure.  Once again.  Someone has paid the price for being original.  22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.  Oh well.  By the comments it looks like plenty of people did like it.  Congratulations anyway!</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your good comment  and your encouragement and I am to agree with you! (22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.)</td>', 'Originally posted by wackybill:I agree.  This shot was super funny and was also the one that stood out for me this week.  I thought for sure It would have gotten 1st or at least 3rd.  You must be right, too many uptight people.  I at least thought this the one of the most artistic shots of the week.  I personally thought it was better than mine but I placed higher than this.  Go figure.  Once again.  Someone has paid the price for being original.  22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.  Oh well.  By the comments it looks like plenty of people did like it.  Congratulations anyway!  Thank you for your good comment  and your encouragement and I am to agree with you! (22 "1''s" for this shot?  I don''t think so!  Some people need to be more open minded.)', '2003-03-10 10:53:53.000000', NULL, 0),
