(232972, 13446, 4520, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dadas115:</b></div><hr/><i>What a rip-off.  I guess there are too many uptite people in here, I fully expected this pic to get 1st place.  GREAT PIC!  I was laughing about this one all week long.  It is the one pic that really stood out for me.<br/> <br/>Greg</i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you Greg, for your good comment! :-) sorry I''m limited because I have a bad english!</td>', 'Originally posted by dadas115:What a rip-off.  I guess there are too many uptite people in here, I fully expected this pic to get 1st place.  GREAT PIC!  I was laughing about this one all week long.  It is the one pic that really stood out for me. Greg Thank you Greg, for your good comment! :-) sorry I''m limited because I have a bad english!', '2003-03-10 10:58:10.000000', NULL, 0),
