(237754, 13453, 3032, '<td valign="top">Could use some unsharp mask. My favorite settings for the dpc sized S602z images are 0.4 radius, 1 treshold and 50 to 200%. Dramatic improvements in sharpness perception can be obtained.<br/> <br/>And the lens is at its best between F5 and F8.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-03-15 18:43:57.</i></td>', 'Could use some unsharp mask. My favorite settings for the dpc sized S602z images are 0.4 radius, 1 treshold and 50 to 200%. Dramatic improvements in sharpness perception can be obtained. And the lens is at its best between F5 and F8.', '2003-03-15 18:42:59.000000', '2003-03-15 18:43:57.000000', 0),
