(238198, 13355, 6532, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments.  I did realize after the submission deadline that this pic was small, as did many other (see comments below).  Unfortunately.  Otherwise, I thought it was a good pic.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments.  I did realize after the submission deadline that this pic was small, as did many other (see comments below).  Unfortunately.  Otherwise, I thought it was a good pic.', '2003-03-16 23:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(240665, 13301, 4584, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the feedback. Yes, the egg has water on it. I was trying to give the impression it was breaking into a sweat while balanced precariously on the edge of the basket. The water would have looked better had it formed beads - I did try, but it didn''t work too well.</td>', 'Thanks for the feedback. Yes, the egg has water on it. I was trying to give the impression it was breaking into a sweat while balanced precariously on the edge of the basket. The water would have looked better had it formed beads - I did try, but it didn''t work too well.', '2003-03-18 19:20:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(242243, 13382, 7364, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, that''s awesome!  Great idea! I think amnesty is the perfect word... or Freggenstein ... Frankenegg ... something like that.  Anyway, your patience paid off, beautiful shot!</td>', 'Holy cow, that''s awesome!  Great idea! I think amnesty is the perfect word... or Freggenstein ... Frankenegg ... something like that.  Anyway, your patience paid off, beautiful shot!', '2003-03-20 14:54:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(246976, 13467, 2553, '<td valign="top">Wow.  I''m going through the still life gallery thumbnails, and this just jumps out at me.  Don''t know why I don''t remember it, but I know I won''t forget it.  Love the lighting and the colors in the photo are beautiful together.  Congratulations on this fine image!</td>', 'Wow.  I''m going through the still life gallery thumbnails, and this just jumps out at me.  Don''t know why I don''t remember it, but I know I won''t forget it.  Love the lighting and the colors in the photo are beautiful together.  Congratulations on this fine image!', '2003-03-26 16:17:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(252426, 13292, 4159, '<td valign="top">I like this.  A combination of good symbolism and well-executed photography.  It''s kind of disturbing that people rated it down because of their "patriotism".  Hope you don''t have an address in your profile.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I like this.  A combination of good symbolism and well-executed photography.  It''s kind of disturbing that people rated it down because of their "patriotism".  Hope you don''t have an address in your profile. ', '2003-04-02 00:24:47.000000', NULL, 0),
