(269788, 13219, 7984, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2003-04-17 18:37:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(293433, 13199, 8488, '<td valign="top">Hrm. Well, it''s a very good picture of an egg, but I don''t know that I see it as a powerful or interesting *image*, as an image.</td>', 'Hrm. Well, it''s a very good picture of an egg, but I don''t know that I see it as a powerful or interesting *image*, as an image.', '2003-05-09 15:23:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(293458, 13199, 714, '<td valign="top">Did you eat it yet?</td>', 'Did you eat it yet?', '2003-05-09 15:52:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(293490, 13199, 714, '<td valign="top">Ok here it goes.  I voted this photo a 4, because of the lack of "Wow" for me.  It is a great picture technically.  I feel it could have been better if you used the rule of thirds. The egg is right in the middle which makes it real boring to look at.  The lighting is good, but maybe use another light on the right side of the egg to get rid of the shadow. Or if you like the shadow on the egg then maybe use a black background.  That would hide the shadow in the background but keep the shadow on the egg. hmmm..<br/>Not sure what else I would have done to make it better.  Keep shooting!!</td>', 'Ok here it goes.  I voted this photo a 4, because of the lack of "Wow" for me.  It is a great picture technically.  I feel it could have been better if you used the rule of thirds. The egg is right in the middle which makes it real boring to look at.  The lighting is good, but maybe use another light on the right side of the egg to get rid of the shadow. Or if you like the shadow on the egg then maybe use a black background.  That would hide the shadow in the background but keep the shadow on the egg. hmmm..Not sure what else I would have done to make it better.  Keep shooting!!', '2003-05-09 16:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(293862, 13199, 7751, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, it is very clean to me. Keep up the good work. I wish I could give some pointers but I wouldn''t know how to make it better. Maybe with some different lighting to make the shadows stronger and more crisp. But for a first submission I think it was great. Oh and by the way, the count is up to 233.</td>', 'I like this photo, it is very clean to me. Keep up the good work. I wish I could give some pointers but I wouldn''t know how to make it better. Maybe with some different lighting to make the shadows stronger and more crisp. But for a first submission I think it was great. Oh and by the way, the count is up to 233.', '2003-05-09 22:54:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(296324, 13403, 3710, '<td valign="top">this is an amazing shot!!!  one can tell that a lot of thought was put <br/>into this and it paid off.... congrats!!</td>', 'this is an amazing shot!!!  one can tell that a lot of thought was put into this and it paid off.... congrats!!', '2003-05-13 04:07:10.000000', NULL, 0),
