(355237, 13292, 7517, '<td valign="top">Despite what most have already said.  I truly think this is a great shot, and Love the symbolism.  This shot can be pointing out any number of issues we have, or had with our country.  That is what makes it a really great shot.</td>', 'Despite what most have already said.  I truly think this is a great shot, and Love the symbolism.  This shot can be pointing out any number of issues we have, or had with our country.  That is what makes it a really great shot.', '2003-07-13 15:30:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(355297, 13292, 1031, '<td valign="top">I must have missed this earlier! Like others have said, really well done in both concept and execution.</td>', 'I must have missed this earlier! Like others have said, really well done in both concept and execution.', '2003-07-13 18:18:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(355308, 13292, 6870, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by cmrk74:</b></div><hr/><i>Despite what most have already said.  I truly think this is a great shot, and Love the symbolism.  This shot can be pointing out any number of issues we have, or had with our country.  That is what makes it a really great shot.</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for this comment. I certainly am not unpatriotic at all, and I do live in the USA. This photo turned out pretty much as I had planned, dirty old flag and all!<br/> <br/>Hey, note the FRENCH title! (er...I mean FREEDOM title!)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-07-13 17:43:32.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by cmrk74:Despite what most have already said.  I truly think this is a great shot, and Love the symbolism.  This shot can be pointing out any number of issues we have, or had with our country.  That is what makes it a really great shot.  Thanks for this comment. I certainly am not unpatriotic at all, and I do live in the USA. This photo turned out pretty much as I had planned, dirty old flag and all! Hey, note the FRENCH title! (er...I mean FREEDOM title!)', '2003-07-13 18:42:02.000000', '2003-07-13 18:43:32.000000', 0),
